Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:53.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,《虎胆龙威3》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹处理组、特勤人员、州警
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有联邦调查局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰金森警官，你和紧急处理中心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现场去防止人员留在街道上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷蒙，去找市政府工程处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须有损害报告，非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹，有谁会想炸掉百货公司？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过女人采购特价的鞋子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,康妮，我要你开始查证名单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇，你和乔要确定穿制服的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在现场妥善的维护秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且别让电视台的人到那去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,文森，你负责交通
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,三点前清理完，否则又要大塞车
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，我想你最好接这通电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,重案组，柯督察
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,单纯的赛门去找蛋糕师傅 他说“给我你的派
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就敲你脑袋”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要了解，爆炸只是想引起注意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问麦克连刑警是否在那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在停职中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，华特，他没有，今天没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那一位？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我赛门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要玩一场游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,“赛门说”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门会告诉麦克连警官去做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而麦克连警官会听命行事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不服从就要面对惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么惩罚？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在公共场所的另外一声“轰”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要麦克连警官去做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门说麦克连警官要去138街
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,和阿姆斯特丹街的转角口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我没记错，应该是在哈林区
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,密瓦斯基，蓝柏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道在那能找到麦克连吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定你能在教堂里找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看他到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他找来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,多给两片
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，你看起来一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开办公室时还剩什么案子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,红灯区有三起杀人事件已拖过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,派麦伦去查
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有吉纳迪，他说可能会来上班
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,长岛有十四辆倾卸车失窃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四辆？有人要开建设公司？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，是约翰蓝利要清理他的公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是保险诈欺，在加州最容易办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,承包商跟小偷一起分赃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纽泽西办过这种案子，记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看凯利能怎么处理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚乐透开什么号码？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是买警徽号码？瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，每周都是买6991
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,6991，幸运号码
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,全纽约的一半警察都是买警徽号码
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说还好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和荷莉说过话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了，督察
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里面很热或只是因为我怕的要命？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去确定枪贴好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，除了荷莉外
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是第一个看到我脱裤子的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,支援会在那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要往后撤到128街
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,离十条街？你在开我玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！老天…这真好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，这究竟是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我不照做，那家伙说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会再炸另一个公共场所
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么是我？与我有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，他只说一定要你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,被需要的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，荷莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，别再提荷莉的事行不行？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务和我的宿醉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们十五分钟后来接你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来，我预期四分钟内会死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走，比利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点十分了，为何不在学校里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,东尼想卖这个给你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,东尼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个没脖子的老兄？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他在垃圾堆找到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老是偷别人东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.30,0:08:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有天某人会发现他倒在垃圾堆里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有偷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说是他叔叔送他的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那边的报纸给我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让别人利用你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着赃物在大街上走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓到时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹上麻烦，他只要否认就能脱身
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你要我们拿回去给汤尼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，我拿回去并告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，你们要去那里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去受教育
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好上大学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它为何那么重要？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便得到尊敬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,受尊敬，谁是坏人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖毒品的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有枪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是好人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会帮你？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么谁会帮助你？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己帮助自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不会帮助我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,白人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这，去上学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔，你最好来看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有个白人站在街上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经看过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不曾看过这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:30.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我恨黑鬼）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去打911
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们快点到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人快要送命了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们上学去，听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天还愉快吗？先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想针对个人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一个白人站在哈林区中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上挂着我恨黑鬼的牌子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是有强烈的个人诉求
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不顾死活了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在对你讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在被那些人看见前还有十秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一他们看见了，就会杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快要有个糟糕的一天了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用你说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，这是警察事务，为您的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这当然是警察的事，为你的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你在警察到之前躲进我店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，我是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在办案，一小时有件爆炸案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在收音机上听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是同一个混球叫我这么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我不做他就炸掉别的，懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我有枪，你该过街去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有十把枪…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该过街去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始装疯，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是个神经病，你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯，你的朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来像我的朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这小子刚从某医院偷跑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是神经病院之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己的神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉图书管理员我的头很痛，但他不信
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要相信，我的头真的很痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的痛真的很痛，我感觉像…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯了一个严重的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那牌子弄掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙，大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这白小子恨黑鬼，我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:11:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着，慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯，你是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！现在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点跑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开车子，下车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来，快站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后，我不想用它但我会用它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们晓得我会用它的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快带我们离开这里，开车！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车，别停下来，闯红灯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去，我只有这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的钱收起来，没人要你的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯红灯就对了，开车！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,割的深吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么晓得？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续施压力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏斯，对吧？我是约翰麦克连
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你一份情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然欠我一份情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们现在会怎么砸我的店？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点？你想和我攀亲带故吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟黑人装熟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏斯，对不起，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何一直叫我苏斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来像波多黎哥人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那些人叫你苏斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是叫我苏斯，是宙斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字叫宙斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，宙斯，阿波罗的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在奥林帕斯，别惹我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我用闪电劈你，我叫宙斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有意见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我没意见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,市区，警察局
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管肤色，列出他逮过的每一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是典型的自大狂，是一种病态
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他幻想能够主宰一切
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要控制他，他的行动、思想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至他的情绪和感情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是你有位神秘的仰慕者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他会送花来给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都晓得你喜欢同性恋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那种感情，这家伙很丑陋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:13:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他冲个澡就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒通常是喝到肚子里的，约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给我几颗阿斯匹灵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿，自己按住这
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是佛列得谢勒，约翰，是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是心理医师，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在应付的是黑夜般个性的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有偏执狂…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,略过这一段，直接告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这与我有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所知道的是这家伙想要打击你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你随着他的节拍起舞，然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我脱掉衣服让他搞？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来要说，杀死你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他目前愤怒异常
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在受到压力时，他必须发泄出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逮捕的人？或是惹火过某人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那名单可长了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的，乔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种人不喜欢匿名行事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要你知道是谁这样对你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以赛门这个名字可能不是假名
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真名或是相关性的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门，罗勃E，86年被捕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑架案，判刑十到十五年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,服刑七年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个月前因行为良好假释
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿穿看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，雷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴伯赛门是个生意人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绑架了合伙人的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是想不开而不是疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的人是疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很懂炸弹的疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在游乐场找到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,职业级的，很正点的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这样摔来摔去的吗？查理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚未混合，不会有害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意很先进，是两液型的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像AB胶，有两种液体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中任何单独一种…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有，但混合它们之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,理奇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要炸掉那张椅子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理，你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我所做的，很正点的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样的包装可以事先预警
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种炸弹要引爆必须解除保险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看见红色液体在引爆之前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,会先泵进透明液体中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸前有多少时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒、两分钟，任何可能都有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦它们混合了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快逃命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意应该很罕见，能查出眉目
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经查到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,利文渥实验室 周末时遭窃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够能再做另一个？乔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,约两千磅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆器可以用任何东西作成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电、电子仪器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至能用呼叫器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一只炸弹有双重回路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当难处理的小技巧，在黎巴嫩…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理，查理！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿着板子游街，但他仍存活着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鸽子还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸽子？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两只鸽子，一黑一白那天飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么飞走，你并不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说麦克连
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我指的是圣诞老人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于出现了，你的朋友呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特，我们在另外一间房需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要你，去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也在这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能和他谈谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位黑皮肤的撒马利亚人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对黑皮肤有意见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，我动了些脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为麦克连准备了那场游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干预了设计好的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把那好计划塞进屁眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这牵涉到人命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不够，督察
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好希望他会再打来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇，去叫外面的人声音小一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门，他不代表我们全部
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很不愉快，别让它再发生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，只是想有幽默感一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想让你回家去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在看起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们查到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你应该加入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在奥斯陆的公用电话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，是墨西哥的佛瑞斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，现在他们说墨西哥的劳瑞斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了，澳洲？他捣乱了整个系统
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不知道他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和电话公司玩得愉快吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门说麦克连和那位先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去72街与百老汇交口地铁站
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十五分后打去那边的公用电话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准有警察，没接电话就算失败
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂吗？约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂，我晓得你是玩小孩的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,差得远了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,差得远？那么你是谁？我抓过的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么？扒手、小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,男扮女装？究竟是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我连人带椅子的把你偷走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也抓不到我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,连人带椅子？那真的很刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我问你一个问题，混球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何想要杀我？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不到警察局来？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以男子汉的方式来解决它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在开玩笑，假如想要杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在早已死透了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门，我很感谢你重视麦克连
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但相信我，那个混球不值得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在警局里得罪了太多人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个月的这个时候他就得站大门
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的妻子也不想和他有任何瓜葛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离真正的酒鬼只有两步之遥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步，一步之遥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，你听起来像个聪明人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道麦克连只不过是只臭虫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他忘掉，从此愉快过一生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道钱对我有如粪土
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使把诺克斯堡的黄金全都给我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会放弃麦克连
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五分后在72街地铁公用电话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连和他那位朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你们还有点能力就已找到皮箱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们就晓得我说的惩罚是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你对我的信心，华特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想至少可以试试
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙已经彻底疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就个案来说他已说得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经给了你有关他的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带德国口音，说你们的诺克斯堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当麦克连激怒他时，他会变口吃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这家伙能用钱摆平吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能，提到钱反而会激怒他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的警徽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又再要我当警察了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇，去把他的枪找来给他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没有回答我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晓得是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没回答我的问题，华特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，警官
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你想准时到72街就得出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔，这一次要给他们后援
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那里都不去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门说你必须得去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会为了神经病而自投罗网
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是白人与白人问题，你去处理
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他过了110街以后再找我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要救我？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我阻止白人警察在哈林区被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有一名白人警察被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.60,0:22:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天就会有上千个白人警察跟进
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个都想藉机开枪，懂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理，你在那找到那颗炸弹的？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐人街
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.60,0:22:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的搭挡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的邻居或朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是位完全的陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，陌生人，你晓得在115街
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和圣尼克拉街的公园吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道，在哈林区
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我们在那找到那颗炸弹的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，那家伙不在乎肤色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎也没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点，有可能会更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.80,0:22:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有段时间我当夜班
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了抽烟之外无所事事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到了电话那，但有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？那问题有多大？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约三百磅重
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，警察事务需要用这座电话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不介意吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士，我是警察，需要这具电话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴快滚，这是警察事务
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没遇见过
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经习惯这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你在对街能找到电话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把话说清楚，我才是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.90,0:23:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也别做那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把话说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要我甚于我需要你们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不喜欢我办事的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.90,0:23:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我需要你甚于你需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,相同羽毛共同飞 猪与下人皆一样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.70,0:24:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇鼠之辈能尝试 我也将有我机会
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，还押韵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话为何占线中？你们打给谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经病专线
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你正经点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是公共电话，你要我怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以直说有个胖女人在用电话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.60,0:24:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了你们一点时间才让她离开
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，你旁边垃圾筒内有炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跑的话它就会立刻爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.30,0:24:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会跑，但这里有上百人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我的意图
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.20,0:24:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意，问题来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.50,0:24:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去圣爱弗时遇到一个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有七位太太
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每位太太有七个麻袋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个麻袋有七头猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.90,0:24:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每头猫生了七只小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猫、猫、袋子、太太…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个人要去圣爱弗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电话号码是555…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我没完全听清楚，再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.00,0:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能，我的电话是555
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.30,0:24:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上答案，三十秒打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就得死
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.80,0:25:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个人有七个太太…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，麦克连，这方面我很行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个人有七个太太…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，麦克连
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说七位太太各有七个袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.10,0:25:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,七乘七是四十九，告诉我剩下的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.50,0:25:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,七个袋子…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.90,0:25:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因宿醉而头痛的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，49再乘每个袋子7只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.40,0:25:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,7乘49是343，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.90,0:25:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，是你告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我说的，7乘343是…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.50,0:25:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,2401，你算出来也一样吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.30,0:25:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，就是那样？5552401
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等一下，是脑筋急转弯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.10,0:25:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.50,0:25:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.60,0:25:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么男人？去他的，还有十秒…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说有几个人要去圣爱弗，对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谜语一开始说一个男的有七位太太
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.20,0:25:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人和他的太太那都不去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.10,0:25:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们要去那？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.20,0:25:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在大路旁等，我怎么会知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁要去圣爱弗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.00,0:26:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人，只有那一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.20,0:26:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么拨1？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.70,0:26:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,555-0001
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人要去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.40,0:26:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗，约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小事一椿，下次出个难一点的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们慢了十秒
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.10,0:26:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，答案是一
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.70,0:26:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾筒里有炸弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.70,0:26:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有炸弹…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.10,0:26:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎到纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，起来吧，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.40,0:26:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.30,0:27:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有说“赛门说”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.00,0:27:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在九点五十了，约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号地铁正抵达那边
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那列火车上留了点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.30,0:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门说在十点二十分之前到新密尔瓦基街
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.30,0:27:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和华尔街地铁站
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.40,0:27:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去接公用电话，否则三号列车升天
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了民用交通工具外用别的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.40,0:27:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就炸火车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.20,0:27:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,想疏散乘客我就炸火车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.00,0:27:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我三十分后打给你们，要到哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.10,0:27:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.00,0:27:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以纽约的交通 三十分内走完九十条街？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能要两倍的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.50,0:27:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至连车都没
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.10,0:27:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，我是警察，因公务徵用车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.30,0:27:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？你快下来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.00,0:27:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前开过计程车，最快的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我以前开过计程车
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.70,0:28:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去第九大道最快方法是往南走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.50,0:28:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们似乎在向东走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.80,0:28:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？麦克连，我说过最…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.90,0:28:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吼了，我知道我在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.10,0:28:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,连上帝都不知道你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.30,0:28:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们向东自72街往公园走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.60,0:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街在南边
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再对我吼，我头痛的要命
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.40,0:28:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,向南走最快的方法不是第九大道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是穿越公园
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.10,0:28:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！老天
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你公园路总是堵车
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说走公园路
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是穿越公园
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.40,0:28:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，我们追丢了，他们往南走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.40,0:28:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.90,0:28:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现他们了，康妮，在公园内
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.90,0:29:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.00,0:29:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！小心！你是朝那些人开过去？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.80,0:29:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有想过
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.10,0:29:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,树！树！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.80,0:29:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.10,0:29:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,树！树！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.50,0:29:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.50,0:29:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头！石头！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.40,0:29:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连！小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.50,0:30:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.90,0:30:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.40,0:30:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天主教徒是怎么做的？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,先由上往下，再向右再向左
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.00,0:30:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,27分了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.10,0:30:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅！72街到百老汇才三分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定是记录
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一辆救火车
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.80,0:30:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.80,0:30:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟在后面
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.10,0:30:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 911专线 - 我是约翰麦克连警官
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警徽号码7479
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.50,0:30:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你们立刻派救护车来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.60,0:30:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，稍候一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.10,0:30:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两位警员在14街第九大道口
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.60,0:30:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,负伤倒地，急需救护车
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会送往河边医院
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.40,0:30:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,距我们要去的地方只有两条街远
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.80,0:31:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的，慢一点，麦克连
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.80,0:31:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和美式足球一样，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.70,0:31:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有人替你开路你直奔得分区
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.40,0:31:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你报华尔街 我们就可以一直跟着它
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.50,0:31:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,错了，第十四街有另外一家医院
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.90,0:31:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣路克医院 坐稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.50,0:31:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,10：02，十八分钟了，还有一半的路
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.10,0:32:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的，坐稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.20,0:32:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你开车
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去那？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先上那列火车去找
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.10,0:32:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能上那列火车
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.20,0:32:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上那列火车
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你十点二十前要赶到那公用电话
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.30,0:32:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找那个炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.60,0:32:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，你失败了我掩护你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.10,0:32:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失败了你掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.30,0:32:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们俩都失败了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.10,0:32:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.10,0:32:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，十点二十前到那公用电话
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的幸运日
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看路
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开…让开
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.70,0:32:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个坏主意
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.30,0:33:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过，借过，请让路
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街112号
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是计程车，你不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的空车灯亮着的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.70,0:33:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把话说明白，华尔街112号
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.30,0:33:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就让你吊牌
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么？你不喜欢白人？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.80,0:34:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街112号，没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.70,0:34:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把脚抬起来，别碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.90,0:34:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:34:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.10,0:35:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过，先生，借过
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让开可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.00,0:35:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警察，请让开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过，请让路
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.50,0:35:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.00,0:35:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰，先生，我在等电话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.00,0:35:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那具电话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.60,0:35:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不用另外一支？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.00,0:36:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，拜托，我需要那具电话
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.50,0:36:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，兄弟，是我先到的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.50,0:36:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,离那电话远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.60,0:36:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.10,0:36:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须接这通电话
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.40,0:36:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，把手举在空中
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.20,0:36:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心，抱歉，借过，小心
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.80,0:36:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，我是纽约市警察
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.00,0:36:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们冷静的朝车那一端移动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.40,0:36:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请现在就走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.10,0:36:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，小心
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.90,0:36:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心，小心…快走
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.20,0:36:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须接那通电话
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.20,0:36:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举高
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.40,0:37:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，你若要开枪就请便
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.90,0:37:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须接这通电话，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.70,0:37:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.70,0:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在路上，他太胖了体能不好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求的是你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这与我的要求不符，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.60,0:37:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.00,0:38:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开那，趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.30,0:39:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.70,0:39:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.60,0:39:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以直接看到地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.80,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了几辆消防车？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.00,0:39:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静，安静
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.00,0:39:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那里怎么看的清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.90,0:39:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,到下面去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.90,0:39:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员，叫那些人退后，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.00,0:39:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大堆人轻伤，几个脑震荡
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.70,0:39:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个老人心律器停了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.20,0:39:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一位孕妇羊水破了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.80,0:39:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的情况如何？约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.80,0:39:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着是个奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.40,0:39:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就出在那了，乔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.90,0:39:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.90,0:39:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇迹的部份
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.60,0:39:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能准时到这的机会有多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,零
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.80,0:40:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗炸弹无论如何都会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要它在这里爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.80,0:40:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这玩意拿掉，大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方为何那么特别？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.70,0:40:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，事情拼凑不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.50,0:40:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连警官？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.60,0:40:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要找你和卡特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.40,0:40:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.50,0:40:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.00,0:40:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，这位是安迪克罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.90,0:40:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是联邦调查局的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.30,0:40:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是查尔斯先生，他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.70,0:40:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是另一个单位的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.90,0:40:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是麦克连警官和卡特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.30,0:40:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先要问几个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.50,0:40:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识这个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.80,0:40:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.90,0:40:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.20,0:40:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.30,0:40:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得出电话上的声音吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.30,0:41:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否注意到有车子在跟踪你？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.10,0:41:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.40,0:41:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何人跟踪你吗？任何监视？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.80,0:41:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话、屋子，任何不寻常的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.80,0:41:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你既然提到了，我的脚趾间烧痛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是香港脚之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在虚应委蛇，他们说你会合作
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.40,0:41:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.30,0:41:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.40,0:41:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙在浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.60,0:41:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想分享情报，回馈一些如何
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.90,0:41:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想先听听他知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.30,0:41:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们让我们看了照片…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.80,0:41:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想知道他知道些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.50,0:41:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道的和你们一样，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.10,0:41:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个家伙在外面到处放炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.90,0:41:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自称叫赛门，说话带德国口音
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.80,0:41:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知为什么他十分生我的气
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.80,0:42:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你们能告诉我是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.70,0:42:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个人叫法瑞斯塔戈
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.10,0:42:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,前匈牙利陆军，爆破专家
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.10,0:42:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信现在是为乌克兰人工作
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.60,0:42:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.70,0:42:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,自主的恐怖份子，受雇于合约
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.30,0:42:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.10,0:42:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的爱人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谣传有人在他们床单下摆了炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.00,0:42:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天他不在家，也许炸死了她
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.80,0:42:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个人是前东德上校安全官
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.20,0:42:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责渗透部队，像坦克大决战中…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.30,0:42:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹德军所做的，派说英文的部队
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.60,0:42:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过那部电影
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.00,0:42:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,医药记录显示他饱受头痛之苦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.30,0:42:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字叫彼得克里格
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.50,0:42:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很卓越的简报，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.20,0:42:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们要告诉我 这到底与我何干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.80,0:43:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁伯这个姓对你有意义吗？警官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有印象
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.70,0:43:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛杉矶，在洛杉矶大楼的那一次
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.60,0:43:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得克里格的原名是赛门彼得鲁伯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.70,0:43:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是汉斯鲁伯的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.10,0:43:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，洛城的那件事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.40,0:43:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们觉得他会尽一切置你于死地
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.40,0:43:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察，是他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.10,0:43:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他知道我们在这
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.70,0:43:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.00,0:43:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得车里联邦调查局的人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.60,0:43:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看，一定有克罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:43:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧，安德鲁，说哈罗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.00,0:44:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.60,0:44:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你从不单枪匹马
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.30,0:44:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以打个招呼吧，比尔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.20,0:44:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是咬眼镜来消除紧张？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.40,0:44:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位先生老是让事情复杂化
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.10,0:44:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在纽约的1446所学校中
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.70,0:44:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了具两千四百磅的炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,定时器设定在下午三点爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.90,0:44:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，我假定你们的沉默表示已了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.40,0:44:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是两千四百磅？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.20,0:44:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，请别再打岔
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.40,0:44:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门说你们若要疏散学校
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.60,0:44:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么炸弹会经无线电引爆
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.30,0:44:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，会有人在监视的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.70,0:44:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午三点 会有一所学校永久消失
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.40,0:44:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.50,0:44:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非约翰麦克连和他的新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.70,0:44:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能完成我为他们所设定的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.70,0:44:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，你在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.50,0:44:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在汤金广场后面有座公用电话
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.00,0:45:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十分钟，用走的，不必赶
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你真的聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.40,0:45:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能知道学校炸弹的位置和密码
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.00,0:45:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外，我们买到便宜的引爆器
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.40,0:45:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是警用及FBI频率会引爆
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.10,0:45:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以假如换成我 我就不会用无线电
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.50,0:45:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门，等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.60,0:45:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千四百磅那液体炸弹，老天
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.00,0:45:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我接局长
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.30,0:45:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在开记者招待会，半小时会到
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.10,0:45:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，瑞奇，集合现场资深警员
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.30,0:45:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我来那套管辖权的狗屁
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.70,0:45:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两个孩子在64街的学校里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.70,0:45:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么帮忙？- 你有多少人？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.80,0:45:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,75人，但紧急求援的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.90,0:45:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能从华府调五百人来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.30,0:45:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候到？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.30,0:45:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,两点半到三点之间
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.70,0:45:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那个时间前…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得独自做这件事，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.40,0:46:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤金广场在两里外，你们得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.80,0:46:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用无线电，带着我的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.90,0:46:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何事，利用报案中心交换机
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.50,0:46:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.60,0:46:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，去找到那颗炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.80,0:46:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇，他们在那？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.00,0:46:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.00,0:46:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最资深的是艾伦队长
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.90,0:46:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个单位？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,交通
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.70,0:46:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，谢谢，瑞奇
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.10,0:46:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，我们有个决定要下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.30,0:46:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成这件事的人说他另外安置了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.10,0:46:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很大的炸弹 就在纽约的某个学校里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.80,0:46:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们不能疏散
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.30,0:46:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没说我们不能搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议我们动员每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.20,0:46:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我指的是每一个公务员
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是警察、交通、消防
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.10,0:46:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至图书馆的人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.70,0:46:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始搜索，从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.70,0:46:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是市内的数千幢建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.40,0:46:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有三小时五十分去完成
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.20,0:46:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要设法尽量不让媒体知道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.20,0:46:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们一涉及就会造成恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.20,0:46:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大家同意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.10,0:47:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大伙们，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.20,0:47:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们相信了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.80,0:47:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.90,0:47:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,筹备、安排…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.60,0:47:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全成功
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.60,0:47:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走！我们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.20,0:48:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,特利巡佐！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.80,0:48:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,特利巡佐，过去五分钟线路爆满
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.90,0:48:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.60,0:48:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,停一下，让我解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.60,0:48:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天剩下的时间里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.70,0:48:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要负责处理局里的通信
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们关闭无线电，电话通通来此
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.40,0:48:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就要嫁给唐诺川普了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.60,0:48:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴伯，怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何大家都撤离这里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.20,0:48:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,潘蜜拉，看看你的表，要换班了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.90,0:48:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长担心加班费的事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.80,0:49:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们让大家回局里打卡下班
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.70,0:49:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一班随时会到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.20,0:49:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是满口胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.80,0:49:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.60,0:49:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.70,0:49:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，巴伯塔克，工程处的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.50,0:49:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去处理损害的部份
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来的可真快
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.40,0:49:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是华尔街，有许多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.60,0:49:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有许多意见很多的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.00,0:49:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长不想得罪他们，你知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.10,0:49:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.40,0:50:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天，有人玩得很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.60,0:50:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你能替我的同事带路我很感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.70,0:50:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.30,0:50:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米，有手电筒吗？墨菲你也来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.50,0:50:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克华许
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.80,0:50:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰康屈
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.00,0:50:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走，各位，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.80,0:50:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能也处理世贸中心案
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们晓得那是什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.70,0:51:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请通知李先生说范登先生来了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,范登先生是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.90,0:51:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有位范登先生找李先生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.40,0:51:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下二十米
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.00,0:51:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面的蒸汽不少
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.10,0:51:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸断不少蒸汽管，像桑拿一样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.20,0:51:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫地铁的人关闭三号轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.10,0:51:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急照明？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.00,0:51:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，用紧急照明，所以仍有光…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.70,0:51:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.00,0:51:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.80,0:51:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说英文
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.70,0:51:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为阿道会说英文，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.20,0:51:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是去那找来的这个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.40,0:51:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是塔戈的人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.90,0:51:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直往前开
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛城是什么事？你很有名？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.50,0:52:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有名了五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.80,0:52:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我，你打黑人对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.20,0:52:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.50,0:52:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们说的那位赛门吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.20,0:52:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在洛城将他弟弟自32楼摔下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.70,0:52:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他对那件事有点生气
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.60,0:52:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，你是在告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.60,0:52:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为某白人警察把某白人混球弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.80,0:52:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,自屋顶扔下来 然后我在这受罪？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.60,0:53:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,范登先生，企业关系部，我姓李
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.20,0:53:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你久等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.10,0:53:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但因地铁爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.10,0:53:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成我们警铃失灵
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.40,0:53:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望没出任何问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.80,0:53:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的，一切安全无恙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.90,0:53:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在考虑货币汇兑的事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.10,0:53:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不是一般的商业银行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.20,0:53:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们主要是政府的中央银行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.00,0:53:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,财政部是主要客户
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.00,0:53:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.40,0:53:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从事花卉生意，范登先生
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.20,0:54:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，范登先生，那是金库的电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.30,0:54:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.60,0:54:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的警铃感应声音与振动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.60,0:54:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为爆炸造成警铃失效
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.10,0:54:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁系统和警铃不太协调
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.70,0:54:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我们必须拔掉它的插头
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.70,0:54:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼下现在只有少数几个人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.60,0:54:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.60,0:54:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.80,0:54:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊，如果谁知道了…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.60,0:54:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…我以为这是货币汇兑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.40,0:55:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们还是直接提款
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.10,0:55:21.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国联邦银行）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.50,0:55:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，你下来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.30,0:55:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.90,0:55:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为如何？贾斯，能修好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.60,0:56:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要再几分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.50,0:56:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.70,0:56:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.60,0:56:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.30,0:56:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.40,0:56:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊！快点
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.50,0:57:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,服务台
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.50,0:57:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点下来，我遭到攻击了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.30,0:57:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松点，也许你能活过此事
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.40,0:57:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.30,0:57:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他已经死了，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.30,0:57:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们上工吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.90,0:57:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，老大
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.00,0:57:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.00,0:58:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，我们在诺克斯堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.10,0:58:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.10,0:58:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一兆四千亿美金
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.20,0:58:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是肯塔基的十倍
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.20,0:58:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺克斯堡
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.00,0:58:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是给观光客看的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.40,0:58:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.90,0:58:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，你体力不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.80,0:58:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差一点没赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.40,0:58:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，差一点没赶到
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.50,0:58:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我们做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.00,0:59:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是四只脚随时预备旅行？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.00,0:59:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.70,0:59:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.80,0:59:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是四只脚随时预备旅行？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.90,0:59:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？你难道没有孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.20,0:59:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个大象的笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.80,0:59:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个就是炸弹了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.00,0:59:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，你过去拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.60,0:59:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.10,0:59:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门说在这件事上你要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.80,0:59:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.90,0:59:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候才要开始帮忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.00,0:59:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你拿到炸弹之后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.50,0:59:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.10,0:59:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,会小心的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.30,0:59:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.10,0:59:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.20,0:59:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.00,0:59:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.20,1:00:10.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我是炸弹 你刚启动了我）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.20,1:00:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，我就说别打开
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.70,1:00:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们已收到了讯息
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.10,1:00:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有遥控回路，所以请你们别跑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.50,1:00:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了，我们不会跑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.30,1:00:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何停止爆炸？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.00,1:00:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷泉那有两个桶子，看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个五加仑、一个三加仑
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.90,1:00:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在其中之一装四加仑水放在秤上
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.40,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,计时器自然会停止
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.60,1:00:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须正确，太多太少都会引爆它
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.10,1:00:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如五分钟后你们还活着 我会再打来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.20,1:00:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.80,1:00:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听懂，你听懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.10,1:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不懂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.20,1:00:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿桶子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.60,1:01:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然我们不能用三加仑桶去装四加仑
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.00,1:01:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.80,1:01:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晓得了，这么办
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.00,1:01:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把三加仑桶装满，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.00,1:01:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把三加仑桶倒入五加仑桶
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.20,1:01:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那五加仑桶就正好有三加仑
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.10,1:01:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.10,1:01:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在三加仑桶内装三分之一…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.40,1:01:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，他说必须要准确是四加仑
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.70,1:01:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑了几里路后还要玩孩子游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.50,1:01:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要专心解决手上的问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.20,1:01:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你知道，还叫我别开口
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.70,1:01:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把桶子给我，我们从头开始
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.10,1:01:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，我们不能再从头开始
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.50,1:01:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把桶子放下来，你这笨王八…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.00,1:01:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊，说出来啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.50,1:02:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要叫我黑鬼，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.90,1:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.80,1:02:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.50,1:02:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你要叫我什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.40,1:02:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,混球！叫你混球，如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.20,1:02:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因我是白人所以你有心结，宙斯
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.30,1:02:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是那样？我对你有偏见吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.40,1:02:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的同胞有偏见吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.20,1:02:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你你有什么问题
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.30,1:02:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有种族歧视
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.00,1:02:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.70,1:02:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有种族歧视
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.50,1:02:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,因我是白人所以你不喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.60,1:02:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你是因你会害我送命
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.50,1:02:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下多少分钟？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.60,1:02:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，我们剩下不到一分钟了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.00,1:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西丢掉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.80,1:02:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能，否则会引爆它
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.60,1:02:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.40,1:02:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想出来，里面有两加仑，对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.90,1:02:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.60,1:02:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下一加仑的空间，对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.40,1:02:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.20,1:02:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是五加仑整，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.60,1:02:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把五加仑倒一加仑出来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.90,1:02:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就刚刚好四加仑
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.40,1:02:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快点倒过去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.60,1:02:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.80,1:02:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别倒洒了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.40,1:02:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，正好四加仑
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.30,1:02:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你办到了，麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.20,1:02:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放到秤上去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.50,1:02:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.30,1:02:56.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（解除）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.00,1:03:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜，你们还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.90,1:03:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.50,1:03:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我们办到了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.70,1:03:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次令我讶异，约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.10,1:03:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这快变成我的嗜好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.20,1:03:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那种时间，赛门，听我说…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.50,1:03:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的，那炸弹在那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.90,1:03:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反，时间还很充裕
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.00,1:03:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.30,1:03:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,两小时四十七分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.50,1:03:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是测试你的智慧的时间
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.60,1:03:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，混蛋，我该死的宿醉未醒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.30,1:03:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经厌倦玩游戏了，炸弹在那？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.10,1:03:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制脾气，约翰 通向真理的道路有许多转折
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.80,1:03:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷泉大象雕像下面有只信封
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.30,1:03:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你依上面建议的路线行走时
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.90,1:03:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时间想这个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.90,1:03:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是42里的21？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经落后进步了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.50,1:03:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应放弃其他的，离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.20,1:04:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松点，塔戈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.50,1:04:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十条街之内没有任何警察
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.50,1:04:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,派主场队到洋基体育馆去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.30,1:04:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是主场队，还有什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.50,1:04:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是42里的21？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.60,1:04:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,21是42的一半，什么的42？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.10,1:04:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,洋基队有多少球员？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.70,1:04:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,25个
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.10,1:04:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么是21的？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.60,1:04:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,21点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.30,1:04:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个俱乐部叫21点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.10,1:04:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全在瞎猜
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.30,1:04:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的车站在那？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.70,1:04:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，也许会有小孩子拿走它
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.40,1:04:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.80,1:04:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我过来，你们两个小王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.40,1:04:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记住你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.40,1:04:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去那？你们在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.70,1:04:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我，猪头
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.20,1:04:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.90,1:04:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要为糖果去住少年感化院？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.00,1:05:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看四周，一个警察也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.00,1:05:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,像圣诞节一样 我能把市政府偷走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.50,1:05:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走，我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.00,1:05:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的脚踏车
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.90,1:05:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去那？我以为要去地铁车站
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.00,1:05:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的脚踏车，混球
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.70,1:05:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干嘛不辗过街上的每一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.80,1:05:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.00,1:05:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛回到这里来？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.30,1:05:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我问你一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.70,1:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街没有什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.30,1:05:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么连你也开始玩猜谜游戏了？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.10,1:05:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打岔，华尔街没有什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.60,1:05:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.40,1:05:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有学校
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.30,1:05:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街有很多的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.20,1:05:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.10,1:05:52.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦准备银行）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.70,1:05:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.40,1:05:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该拿这个怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.90,1:06:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给那边的那几个人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.70,1:06:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.10,1:06:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得说清楚一点
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.30,1:06:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连来了，他正走向银行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.50,1:06:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那黑人则朝我而来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.10,1:06:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.10,1:06:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他们去体育馆的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.60,1:06:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门，杀了他，别再和他玩了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.40,1:06:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就把他杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.60,1:06:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，就这样吧，愿他安息
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.70,1:06:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾林还有四个人在大厅
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.20,1:06:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们收拾一下离开那里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.10,1:06:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一个呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.30,1:06:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警员先生
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.40,1:06:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕那件事上我需要答案
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.30,1:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.70,1:06:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.00,1:06:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.20,1:06:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰麦克连要我把这个给你们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.40,1:06:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，别打开，是颗炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.20,1:06:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.60,1:07:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了，我们会料理的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.60,1:07:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须走了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.60,1:07:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，谢谢你的协助，感谢之至
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.70,1:07:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.80,1:07:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要和它共乘一车
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.80,1:07:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子可能…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.10,1:07:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它放在后面
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.90,1:07:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就这样离开这了？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.80,1:07:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.30,1:07:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.50,1:07:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.10,1:07:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约警局，约翰麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.90,1:07:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.00,1:08:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，今天是洗衣日
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.40,1:08:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何效劳之处？警官
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.70,1:08:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天一早上都那么安静吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.50,1:08:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了两小时前的爆炸之外
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.90,1:08:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去一小时没什么奇怪的事？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.10,1:08:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.00,1:08:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这里还有警察
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.10,1:08:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁出事后他们就一直在那
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.30,1:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正要去金库层巡逻
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.10,1:08:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你想一道来的话
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.30,1:08:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.10,1:08:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.20,1:08:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为天气情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.60,1:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏天到了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.30,1:08:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像待会要下“大盆倾雨”
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.90,1:08:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.30,1:08:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿道刑警，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.20,1:08:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.90,1:08:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.90,1:08:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我想走楼梯，运动一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.90,1:08:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,像今天这种天
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.10,1:08:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎还是搭电梯比较好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.90,1:09:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚乐透开几号？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.80,1:09:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人玩乐透吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.40,1:09:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太太每周替我买两张乐透彩券
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.70,1:09:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去十年都买同样的号码
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.10,1:09:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问她为何不买别的号码？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.10,1:09:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说那是她的幸运号码
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.40,1:09:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩券就在这
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.60,1:09:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下！现在就放下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.80,1:10:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗，下面有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.20,1:10:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来！马上！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.40,1:10:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，约翰，不
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.30,1:10:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，你差点让我心脏病发作
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.10,1:10:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.60,1:10:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.00,1:10:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我的血
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.40,1:10:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下面是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.30,1:10:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你四处去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.30,1:10:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连，大伙都到那去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.00,1:10:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的赛门说
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.60,1:11:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.30,1:11:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本不是什么复仇
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.70,1:11:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是抢劫
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.50,1:11:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些房间是装什么的？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.10,1:11:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,装这个
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.60,1:11:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.70,1:11:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，这是黄金？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.50,1:11:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.40,1:11:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的很重
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.80,1:11:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们弄走一屋子的这个？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.30,1:11:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.00,1:11:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那需要货柜或…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.60,1:11:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾卸车
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.00,1:11:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四辆大倾卸车
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.30,1:11:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点被倾卸车撞到
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.30,1:11:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.70,1:11:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.30,1:11:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西放下来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.50,1:11:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.40,1:11:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会让你留着的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.50,1:11:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.70,1:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一辆车
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆车？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.70,1:11:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么接通点火吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.20,1:11:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会，我是电气技师
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.40,1:11:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.00,1:11:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,花的时间太长
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.30,1:12:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在桥上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.60,1:12:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下面，麦克连，在罗斯福路上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.40,1:12:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走，快点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.00,1:12:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.90,1:12:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.40,1:12:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把电话摔坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.60,1:12:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不幸了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.20,1:12:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是42里的21？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.90,1:12:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.00,1:12:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,洋基体育馆呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.00,1:12:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会去那里，但那不重要
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让那混蛋离开曼哈顿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.90,1:12:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,开快点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.00,1:12:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，你以为你是希拉里？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.80,1:12:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了，柯林顿夫人，42任总统
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.90,1:12:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该是第43任总统
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.40,1:12:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便啦，但谁是第21任？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.90,1:12:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.70,1:12:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.40,1:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.70,1:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.80,1:12:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车的引擎太烂了，加速啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.10,1:12:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它那里也去不了，稍安勿燥
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.60,1:12:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.90,1:12:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再找个电话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.60,1:13:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.00,1:13:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是第21任总统？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去死
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.70,1:13:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙火大了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.80,1:13:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的东西留在后座了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.50,1:13:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，那是我的金条
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.70,1:13:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是麦克连，接华特柯督察
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.30,1:13:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，你在那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.80,1:13:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，不是复仇，是抢劫
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.60,1:13:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.50,1:13:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦准备银行的金库有黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.10,1:13:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们搞走了一大堆
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.40,1:13:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们驾倾卸车朝北走
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.10,1:13:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝酒了吗？麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.00,1:13:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,自今天早上起就没喝了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.80,1:13:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯福路和70街上有倾卸车队
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.10,1:13:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关闭桥梁，派直升机到那去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.90,1:13:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在连热狗摊也赶不走
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.50,1:13:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警力全散开了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.40,1:13:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个炸弹要怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.20,1:13:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出来谁是第21任总统
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.80,1:13:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他有关系
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.80,1:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，第21任什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.80,1:13:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.90,1:13:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，什么烂电话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.90,1:13:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找门罗，叫他把59街以来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.80,1:13:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的桥梁都封闭掉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.00,1:13:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找倾卸车
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.90,1:13:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾卸车？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.10,1:13:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连说倾卸车在罗斯福路上
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.80,1:14:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,装了满车的黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.40,1:14:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，罗斯福路禁行倾卸车
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.50,1:14:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.30,1:14:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,行，你不要我争我就不争
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.30,1:14:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是多愚蠢的事
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.30,1:14:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,警犬队，到后面去查锅炉室
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.50,1:14:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么了吗？查理
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.30,1:14:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着X光机在这待一个星期
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.50,1:14:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是什么都找不到
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.70,1:14:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有一星期，查理，五分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.80,1:14:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就要到86街去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.40,1:14:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经尽快在这了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.60,1:14:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.20,1:14:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连提到联邦准备银行大厦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.10,1:14:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不就在华尔街爆炸案范围内？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.70,1:14:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我们在这待多久？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.40,1:14:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在体育馆的人，撤还是留？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.00,1:14:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔现在应该要回报了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.30,1:14:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.00,1:15:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原处，麦克连也许会出现
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.00,1:15:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松，塔戈
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.00,1:15:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就算还活着也不会和别人讲话
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.50,1:15:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个出口
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.30,1:15:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由发表，你在播出了，什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.70,1:15:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我要告诉你节目有多精彩
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.80,1:15:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在听你的节目
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.40,1:15:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，你想谈什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.90,1:15:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道目前警察到处跑来跑去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.90,1:15:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,晓得他们在干什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.20,1:15:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某学校有一颗炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.90,1:15:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表哥是警察
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.50,1:15:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在某学校放了颗大炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.80,1:15:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是他们不知是那所学校
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.00,1:15:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是搜索每一座学校
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.80,1:15:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纽约市的每一所学校
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.50,1:15:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.80,1:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,朵瑞丝
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.50,1:15:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,朵瑞丝，能联络上我太太吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.60,1:15:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,特利，半座城市在找911
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.50,1:15:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.00,1:15:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.70,1:15:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.50,1:15:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁？胡迪尼？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.70,1:15:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.60,1:15:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.70,1:16:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意有安全气囊吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.20,1:16:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有，我的车有，我不知…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.40,1:16:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.50,1:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车里的人让我看见你的手
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.60,1:16:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在车门上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.70,1:16:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.70,1:16:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是卡车司机？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.60,1:16:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我是美容家，我当然是司机
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把这辆卡车开到那里去？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.30,1:16:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,下水道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.50,1:16:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把倾卸车开去下水道干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.40,1:16:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，是污水下水道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.20,1:16:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下水道？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.70,1:17:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到吗？由这直通凯斯密山
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.20,1:17:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.20,1:17:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边，水管延伸到六十里长
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.70,1:17:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是工头？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.50,1:17:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约市警察
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.20,1:17:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去几分钟有倾卸车通过吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开罚单给它们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.90,1:17:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不听指挥
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.90,1:17:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.00,1:17:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有十二辆冲进水管里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.70,1:17:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经不再在那里装了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.90,1:17:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里装
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.00,1:17:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得不走桥，不怕直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.30,1:17:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有地图显示隧道通到那吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.30,1:17:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.80,1:17:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们由锯木厂开始到考佛坝
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.70,1:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,由那里我们已经把水接通了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.90,1:17:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何方法能进出那里吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.50,1:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔两里有一个通风口
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.80,1:17:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指卡车
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.20,1:17:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了考佛坝，卡车可以进出
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.20,1:17:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着沙尔公园路走，大概二十里路
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.50,1:18:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你在那边见，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.90,1:18:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，我要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.70,1:18:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去洋基体育馆
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.60,1:18:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.50,1:18:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，我们剩下不到二小时
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.70,1:18:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.80,1:18:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.20,1:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们移走480码的岩块
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.70,1:18:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是胡佛坝的十倍
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.80,1:18:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们头顶上有516尺厚的岩块
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.00,1:18:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部份是三号隧道的第三阶段
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.80,1:18:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,自1954年开始设计
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.90,1:18:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到1970年六月才开始动工
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.90,1:18:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道三号道最有趣的是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.60,1:18:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么？杰瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.50,1:18:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是通气口，每个通风口…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.80,1:18:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…自一、二号隧道离开
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.30,1:18:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.10,1:18:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是抛锚的好地方
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.00,1:18:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，杰瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.70,1:18:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的安全帽给我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.00,1:18:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有外套吗？杰瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.00,1:19:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.90,1:19:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等一会儿
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.00,1:19:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他走到门旁的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.20,1:19:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，米奇欧布莱，安全官
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.40,1:19:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接获报告说有人闯进来 呃…骑着八只驯鹿
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.50,1:19:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是个留雪白胡子的肥老头子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.50,1:19:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着红白衣服
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.00,1:19:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很讶异你们没看到他
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.50,1:19:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙原来是用电话
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.80,1:19:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该还有别的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.00,1:19:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，那家伙死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.00,1:19:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰瑞，我想他是死了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.50,1:19:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.40,1:19:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去找一个姓柯的督察
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.70,1:19:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的上司，叫他赶到这里来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.80,1:19:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是约翰麦克连叫你去的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.90,1:19:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他查出谁是第21任总统？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.70,1:19:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特·A·亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.70,1:20:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.60,1:20:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特·A·亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.60,1:20:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,1881年到1885年
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.40,1:20:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,1880年被提名当选副总统
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.60,1:20:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他是纽约海关关员吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.00,1:20:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，杰瑞，保重
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.50,1:20:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.60,1:20:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，只有其中一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.40,1:20:57.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（游戏结束）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.20,1:21:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要还是不要
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.50,1:21:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要还是不要
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.00,1:21:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.90,1:21:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟踪他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.30,1:21:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视在播我们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.80,1:21:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,得先让这些交通队的人先走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.10,1:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，交通队能照顾自己
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.00,1:21:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去查一下这玩意有什么不对？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.50,1:21:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,频率拥塞
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.40,1:21:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.20,1:21:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，我联络不到他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.50,1:21:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但华特，联邦准备银行…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.90,1:21:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,存放着全世界的黄金储备
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.40,1:21:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一组人到那去，找到瑞奇
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.70,1:21:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出来出了什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.90,1:21:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.30,1:21:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得听听这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.30,1:21:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我们是走后门
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.50,1:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是后门，华特
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.30,1:21:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,半小时后全市的校园都会有暴动
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.80,1:21:59.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（切斯特·A·亚瑟国民学校）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.10,1:22:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们由顶楼开始，每层二十人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.60,1:22:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外五十人和我们到地下室去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.10,1:22:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.10,1:22:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没，占线的信号
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.10,1:22:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特可能是最糟的…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.50,1:22:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有点是孤注一掷，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.00,1:22:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说万一麦克连错了呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.40,1:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，这是马丁奈兹校长
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.50,1:22:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁奈兹校长，柯督察
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.10,1:22:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察，你好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.10,1:22:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，校长
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.30,1:22:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你的孩子们紧张
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.10,1:22:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你把他们都带去礼堂
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.00,1:22:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接近水坝了，可以叫后卫了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.30,1:22:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄尔，你可以后撤了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.10,1:22:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已通过了水坝，可以后撤了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.30,1:23:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,缪斯
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.20,1:23:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以后撤了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.20,1:23:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,缪斯
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.40,1:23:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意，缪斯已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.00,1:23:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重复，缪斯已死了，帕尔也死了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.50,1:23:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有自东德来的那四个人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.30,1:23:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在银行的那些人会慢一点
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.80,1:23:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.50,1:23:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开的那卡车有一百三十亿黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.20,1:23:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得是否能打个交道？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.40,1:23:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个提议 你趴在石头上
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.10,1:23:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车从你屁股上碾过去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.60,1:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真多采多姿
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.30,1:23:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你别和他玩
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.60,1:23:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，那真的很有帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.80,1:23:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会危急整次行动和合约
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.60,1:23:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上船之前我们容易受伤害
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.10,1:23:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把此事做一个了结
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.40,1:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.80,1:24:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔戈，到这边来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.30,1:24:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把水坝炸掉
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.40,1:24:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.50,1:24:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们淹死他
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.00,1:24:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.50,1:24:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.40,1:24:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上十点半送来的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.50,1:24:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有接上线
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.80,1:24:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来看看前面
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.70,1:24:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们钻开铰链，叫大家出去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.60,1:27:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.50,1:27:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.30,1:27:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.40,1:27:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.00,1:27:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是有办法回到地面上来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.70,1:27:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.70,1:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去过洋基体育馆了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.10,1:27:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去了，那里没有人
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.40,1:27:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定没有人？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.40,1:27:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.40,1:27:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人跟踪你？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.80,1:27:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你是他在恶整我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.10,1:27:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.50,1:27:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.40,1:27:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说没有人跟踪你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.00,1:27:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.40,1:27:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了，拉开吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.50,1:27:52.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（解除引爆密码）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.60,1:28:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你可以停止搜索了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.30,1:28:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让它停下来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.20,1:28:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不该碰它
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.70,1:28:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁晓得这玩意装了什么诡雷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.10,1:28:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.40,1:28:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有消息
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.80,1:28:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何时疏散？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.10,1:28:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛门说有学童离开他就引爆
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.80,1:28:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有还在监视下的风险
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.30,1:28:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不能坐以待毙啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.30,1:28:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.50,1:28:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,头低一点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.40,1:28:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.30,1:28:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.00,1:28:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.90,1:28:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.00,1:28:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查出来谁是第21任总统了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.80,1:28:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.60,1:28:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特·A·亚瑟
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.20,1:28:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特·A·亚瑟？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.30,1:28:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，你可以再说一次
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.40,1:29:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯特·A·亚瑟国民学校？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.80,1:29:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.60,1:29:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家注意，我知道周五才会集合
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.30,1:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天是特别的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.90,1:29:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝柏先生是消防队的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.30,1:29:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要做一次全新的消防演习
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.60,1:29:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要你们分成两组
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.80,1:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一组到那边靠着墙排成一行
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.60,1:29:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一组到那边去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.90,1:29:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你们又快又安静的做好，好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.60,1:29:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家站起来，老师请协助一下
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.50,1:29:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,消防演习个屁，他不是消防队的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.70,1:29:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是收音机的那件事
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.90,1:30:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他们在抓我们？不
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.00,1:30:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,东尼把我们供出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.00,1:30:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他没有
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.20,1:30:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.50,1:30:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.30,1:30:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我开
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.80,1:30:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.40,1:30:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前为何不告诉我？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.10,1:30:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然会炸掉那所学校
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.40,1:30:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为何要那么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.40,1:30:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为要吸引警方的注意力
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.70,1:30:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找保险丝盒
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.80,1:30:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.60,1:30:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险丝盒，保险丝盒在那？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.20,1:30:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.10,1:30:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把引擎的保险丝拆下来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.70,1:30:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道那一个是引擎的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.70,1:30:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把它全都拆掉
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.70,1:30:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,头低下来，情况会很糟
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.70,1:30:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，抓稳了，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.70,1:31:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.70,1:31:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有最高级的车子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.70,1:31:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.60,1:31:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续找
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.70,1:31:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,校工在最后一次检查所有建筑物
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.60,1:31:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，马丁奈兹校长
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.30,1:31:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.10,1:31:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一张，他一张…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.80,1:31:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持低姿势
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.10,1:32:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.20,1:32:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,询问他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.30,1:32:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会告诉你什么？我已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.00,1:32:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，所以我才会问他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.10,1:32:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕过去看杂物箱内
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.30,1:32:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否有阿斯匹灵
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.40,1:32:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都没有，你去找
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.10,1:32:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,十个两毛五，倾卸车那个人也有
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.50,1:32:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是要打长途电话
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.30,1:32:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，是过桥费
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.60,1:32:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那，在墙边，倾卸车，就在那
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.70,1:32:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，他们已经装上船了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.00,1:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，海岸防卫队呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.60,1:32:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一小时才会到
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.70,1:32:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.50,1:32:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以跳下去
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.50,1:32:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.40,1:32:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以跳下去
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.30,1:33:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了，离甲板有一百尺
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.30,1:33:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但到吊杆没那么远
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.00,1:33:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢缆会把你切成两半
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.90,1:33:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办得到
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.10,1:33:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯，下来，看看车上有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.80,1:33:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个诡雷，四条死胡同
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.40,1:33:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有部份是真的通路
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.40,1:33:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，亲爱滴，我们开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.40,1:33:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要像赛跑那样
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.00,1:33:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我说跑的时候，你们拚命向前跑
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.70,1:33:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着警察及消防队员
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.70,1:33:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是我的领队
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.80,1:33:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，我想我们要动身了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.20,1:33:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，乔，我们等
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.10,1:33:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连还在设法找密码
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.00,1:33:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要勾在那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.30,1:33:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,勾在那边，就是那边
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.30,1:33:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那边，你的位置还可以
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.30,1:33:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到它了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.90,1:33:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，这需要奇迹才行
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.40,1:33:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手合十吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.70,1:33:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住，你快勾到了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.80,1:33:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.80,1:34:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去那？在赶什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.90,1:34:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我先下去，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.70,1:34:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻界来了，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.70,1:34:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,华特，孩子们也许没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.20,1:34:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不出发我都要尿裤子了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.90,1:34:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要等，康妮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.90,1:34:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等六分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.40,1:34:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.20,1:34:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.90,1:34:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那下面
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.00,1:34:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.00,1:34:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，快，快
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.30,1:35:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，谢谢你说服我别跳
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.00,1:35:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬他的脚
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.50,1:36:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西你们得看一下
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.20,1:36:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.20,1:36:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.10,1:36:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.80,1:36:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，现在
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.30,1:36:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在货柜里的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.80,1:36:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找赛门逼问那密码
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.20,1:36:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.90,1:36:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它怎么用？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.90,1:36:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会开枪？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.20,1:36:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们黑人不是全都会用枪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.70,1:36:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这种族歧视的混球
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.10,1:36:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,告我吧，把那往后拉再扣扳机
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.80,1:36:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.50,1:36:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而已？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.30,1:36:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此而己，别射到自己了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.20,1:36:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逞英雄，找到他就来找我
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.90,1:38:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定好自动驾驶了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.50,1:38:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.80,1:38:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.10,1:38:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.80,1:38:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒马利亚人
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.30,1:38:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把密码给我
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.60,1:38:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.10,1:38:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说为了学校那件事？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.90,1:38:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我不能那么做
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.80,1:38:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就叫人取消密码
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.80,1:38:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我把你这变态轰下地狱
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.50,1:38:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如那是你得做的…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.30,1:38:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,得先开保险
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.90,1:38:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.20,1:38:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才能开枪，麦克连在那？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.50,1:39:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.30,1:39:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说别开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.90,1:39:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，查理，我们要疏散了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.80,1:39:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动身
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.00,1:39:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到他说的了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.60,1:39:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动身
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.40,1:39:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的口令
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.70,1:39:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,五、四、三、二、一、动身
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.00,1:39:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.70,1:39:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动身吧！大伙们走！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.40,1:39:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑！跑！跑！大家跑快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.40,1:40:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.80,1:40:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去那？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.70,1:40:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去那？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.90,1:40:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次都以为杀死你了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.30,1:40:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你总是阴魂不散
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.10,1:40:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那么容易放弃的，朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.80,1:40:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在要去那？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.50,1:40:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要逮捕我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.30,1:40:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我不会逮捕你
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.50,1:40:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早知道是胡扯，没人在监视
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.00,1:40:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该把查理叫出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.80,1:40:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了，查尔斯，时间到了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.90,1:41:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我三十秒
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.30,1:41:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是孩子也要一分十五秒，查理
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.50,1:41:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上次看你时你还不轻，快走
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.10,1:41:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.90,1:41:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们弄出来
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.60,1:41:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,门锁着的！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.40,1:41:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走，乔
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.50,1:41:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.30,1:41:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们弄上屋顶
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.90,1:41:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？华特
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.80,1:41:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,建筑物里还有孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.20,1:41:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下来
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.50,1:41:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，查理，离开那里
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.00,1:41:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过亚历山大那个节目吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.00,1:41:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在节目上做什么比赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.90,1:41:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我要让你尝尝滋味
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.00,1:41:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.70,1:42:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.90,1:42:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.20,1:42:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那？华特
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.40,1:42:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.50,1:42:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有胆子就没有荣耀
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.60,1:42:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到屋顶上去还能跳到隔壁幢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.00,1:42:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.20,1:42:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.30,1:42:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.80,1:42:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到上面来，快！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.30,1:42:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急求救！呼叫海岸防卫队
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.20,1:43:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，孩子们
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.50,1:43:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎，太宽了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.10,1:43:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下来
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.60,1:43:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有胆子就没有荣耀
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.00,1:43:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们停在港口的中央
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.20,1:43:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能等吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.20,1:43:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然能等
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.20,1:43:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,煎饼枫糖浆？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.60,1:43:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨！笨！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.40,1:44:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗，约翰麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.80,1:44:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的有学校炸弹，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.20,1:44:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有，我是军人不是怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.00,1:44:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有时候我为怪物工作
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.10,1:44:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的炸弹在这艘船上
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.50,1:44:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸防卫队
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.20,1:44:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他们船在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.50,1:44:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.30,1:44:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不尽然
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.40,1:44:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸防卫队，请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.20,1:44:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把你保留在线上？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.80,1:44:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我等
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.30,1:44:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！我真喜爱这个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.80,1:44:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你弟弟是个混球吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.70,1:44:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的是
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.90,1:44:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.90,1:44:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的是，你说对了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.50,1:44:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.50,1:45:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，请协助麦克连到下面去
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.50,1:45:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.00,1:45:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经联络了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.80,1:45:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸防卫队，请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.60,1:45:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸防卫队
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.70,1:45:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接了，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.60,1:45:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.60,1:45:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否能记录一项讯息
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.50,1:45:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,行
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.40,1:45:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.70,1:45:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.40,1:45:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是CRF的宣言
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.20,1:45:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长久以来西方窃取世界的财富
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.10,1:45:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把维护人道的责任 交给了造成饥荒的经济
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.90,1:45:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们要让大家有同等立足点
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.00,1:45:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后联邦储备银行的黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.30,1:45:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们经济的立足点
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.20,1:45:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在爆炸后
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.40,1:45:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉碎于长岛边的海底
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.10,1:45:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你们有幸，竭诚欢迎观赏
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.10,1:46:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把它们全炸掉？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.00,1:46:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是那个意思
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.50,1:46:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,中东某位先生认为能从中获暴利
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.20,1:46:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看着大家安全的离开
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.00,1:46:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在船舷边会合
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.00,1:46:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为何要杀麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.10,1:46:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是人生的红利
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.70,1:46:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说你不喜欢你弟弟？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.10,1:46:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢他是一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.50,1:46:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但被个笨爱尔兰人扔出窗户不同
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.20,1:46:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不认识那个王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.60,1:46:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没有请你到船上来
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.70,1:46:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么方法能停止这玩意吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.10,1:46:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有密码、没有谜语、没有倒数计时
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.30,1:46:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪头
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.40,1:46:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，就是你，猪头
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.50,1:46:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我必须知道
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.00,1:46:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有阿斯匹灵吗？我头痛了一天
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.80,1:46:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你的幸运日
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.90,1:46:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,整瓶留着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.20,1:47:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金在那？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.30,1:47:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他背叛了我们，货柜里全是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.70,1:47:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我若没有救你就不会在这了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.60,1:47:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有炸弹及值一兆美金的黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.90,1:48:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有坏消息，你不会和我一起炸掉
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.20,1:48:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.00,1:48:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上没有黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.30,1:48:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.30,1:48:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解那人，我恰好认识他的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.20,1:48:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比炸掉一兆美金黄金更好的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.90,1:48:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是让别人认为他那么做了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.20,1:48:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么它会在那？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.50,1:48:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是在码头调了包
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.70,1:48:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该要让你觉得好过点吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.30,1:48:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.60,1:48:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对别的事也错了，你不会死
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.60,1:48:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晓得某种警察技俩能松开手铐
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.80,1:48:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，有把钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.60,1:48:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开这种锁吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.00,1:48:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是黑人的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.10,1:48:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来那套种族问题的争论
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.40,1:48:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底会不会开锁？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.90,1:48:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会，假如我有工具的话
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.50,1:48:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一节电线芯
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.30,1:48:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也许可以
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.10,1:48:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.70,1:48:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.80,1:48:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.90,1:48:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个行不行？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.60,1:48:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有用
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.80,1:48:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吐到你的手上，把手伸过来
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.80,1:48:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把它丢掉了，行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.60,1:48:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐好一点
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.60,1:48:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.00,1:48:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.90,1:49:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.10,1:49:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.50,1:49:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，把你的手移开
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.10,1:49:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连，我开始喜欢你了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.60,1:49:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喜欢我，我是个混球
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.40,1:49:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.40,1:49:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你说谎，宙斯
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.70,1:49:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.40,1:49:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我告诉你炸弹在哈林区找到
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.20,1:49:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是在唐人街找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.00,1:49:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真低级 就算你是混帐白人也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.20,1:49:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我说我是混球
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.00,1:49:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.20,1:49:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.90,1:49:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我唯一能让你跟我走的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.90,1:49:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你结婚了吗？麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.10,1:49:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.30,1:49:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然有人能够忍受你 还跟你结婚
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.70,1:49:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我们在一起也没太久 现在大概是分开了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.90,1:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫大概是？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.20,1:49:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她住洛城我在纽约
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.50,1:49:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在电话上吵架，她挂断电话
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.50,1:49:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有再打过去
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.20,1:49:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是多久之前
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.50,1:49:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约是一年前了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.90,1:49:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约一年…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.30,1:50:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在笑什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.20,1:50:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真疯了？笨到不会拿起电话来
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.10,1:50:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为那很好笑？笑别人的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.40,1:50:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一切都怪罪你太太，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.40,1:50:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太太是个很固执的女人，是的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.40,1:50:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑了，快点解开手铐
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.10,1:50:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，这样如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.20,1:50:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.90,1:50:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.80,1:50:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那玩意给弄掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.70,1:50:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是笨
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.40,1:50:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西掉到那里去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.90,1:50:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找到它
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.90,1:50:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没看见
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.60,1:50:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.50,1:50:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我让它生气了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.60,1:50:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，麦克连，快离开这
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.10,1:50:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须想个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.30,1:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连，听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.60,1:50:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.10,1:50:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们待在一起一天了都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.00,1:50:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想良心上愧疚，闭嘴快设法
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.80,1:50:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，工具，轮机室有工具
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.50,1:50:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.30,1:50:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.60,1:50:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在混合
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.50,1:51:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.50,1:51:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.40,1:51:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备好，往前倾
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.40,1:51:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.20,1:51:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前倾
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.30,1:51:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.20,1:51:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要爆炸，往前倾
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.90,1:51:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.80,1:51:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前倾
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.60,1:51:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不做你就会死
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.60,1:51:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.70,1:51:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.60,1:51:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.70,1:51:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.60,1:51:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.10,1:51:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站着，快走！快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.00,1:51:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！上去
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.50,1:51:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.00,1:51:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能停，快走，要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.30,1:51:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳水
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.70,1:51:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.60,1:51:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.80,1:51:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！跳下去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.20,1:52:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.70,1:52:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我腿部中枪，你认为呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.50,1:52:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.70,1:52:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.80,1:52:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，把瑞奇抬出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.20,1:52:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.50,1:52:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.00,1:52:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头痛的要命，他们生我气吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.30,1:52:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会去担心他们
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.80,1:52:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后他们会去找你
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.00,1:52:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在他们忙着打捞作业
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.40,1:52:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，是卓吉斯
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.80,1:52:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在浪费时间，下面没有黄金
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.20,1:52:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.20,1:52:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带走了，他打败我了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.90,1:52:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，他打败了我们每一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.50,1:52:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是针对你来的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.80,1:52:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的，麦克连，你还活着吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.60,1:52:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.70,1:52:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他输了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.60,1:53:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝柏，给他两毛五
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.00,1:53:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,混球
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.20,1:53:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是约翰打的对方付费电话
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.90,1:53:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡门，告诉她，她会付费的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.40,1:53:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那王八蛋真的有阿斯匹灵
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.80,1:53:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约翰，我还好，荷莉在吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.30,1:53:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.10,1:53:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,宙斯，等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.30,1:53:51.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北方边界）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.80,1:54:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.50,1:54:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天我们是支没有国家的军队
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.70,1:54:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们得决定买那个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.80,1:54:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,切记，都是因为有你们
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.80,1:54:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会有这一切成果
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.20,1:54:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬纽约市警局
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.90,1:54:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬死去的同志
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.50,1:55:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布德曼，你接手
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.60,1:55:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大家听着
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.10,1:55:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一班半小时后搭校车出发
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.80,1:55:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机在诺瓦史考提亚
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.90,1:55:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能在十分钟内离开
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.10,1:55:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不急
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.70,1:55:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,范洛根
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.20,1:55:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当神父
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.00,1:56:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光，把灯光灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.60,1:56:31.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北方边界）
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.80,1:56:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪头！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.70,1:56:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来的时机不对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.00,1:56:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她生你的气了，麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.30,1:57:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我们正下方，转回来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.30,1:57:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错，快逃命吧！- 宙斯，会从你那边出现
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.50,1:57:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像蟑螂看到光就都出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.10,1:57:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去诺瓦史考提亚吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.80,1:57:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和卡车一起走，我有私事要处理
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.10,1:57:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上工去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.80,1:57:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，逃命吧，把你们了结掉
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.80,1:57:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.30,1:57:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面有东西
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.90,1:58:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦在我们后面
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.20,1:58:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上有枪吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.90,1:58:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.90,1:58:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我们后面
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.00,1:58:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住，我什么都看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.90,1:58:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.30,1:58:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.60,1:58:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.10,1:58:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了，我们要下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.00,1:58:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心电线！电线
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.00,1:58:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克连，搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.30,1:58:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有烟，到处都是烟在熏我
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.60,1:58:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车！卡车！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.60,1:58:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住，我们下降了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.10,1:58:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走，我们必须离开这
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.60,1:58:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他随时会对我们开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.00,1:58:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.80,1:58:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.60,1:58:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,插梢卡住了，我弄不掉它
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.50,1:58:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.40,1:58:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄不开，麦克连
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.40,1:58:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他弄走
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.50,1:58:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去那？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.20,1:59:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着吸引他的注意
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.70,1:59:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.30,1:59:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越精彩了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.90,1:59:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想不到加拿大这么好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.60,1:59:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点可以射击的东西，快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.30,1:59:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我能扔到他脸上去
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.70,2:00:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你弟弟问好
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.70,2:00:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.90,2:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见啦！王八蛋
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.90,2:00:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你吸引到了他的注意力
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.70,2:00:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是那样
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.80,2:00:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该叫消防车
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.40,2:00:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的，让他烧吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.60,2:00:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.40,2:00:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.10,2:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.50,2:00:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让荷莉在电话上等着
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.20,2:00:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再打给她
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.40,2:00:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会火大的
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.10,2:00:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,会过去的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.30,2:01:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，宙斯
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.40,2:01:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同我所说的，她很固执
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.10,2:01:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是她凑巧嫁给了你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Helen，bomb squad，special services，state police
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the FBI！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Jergenson，you and Palmer，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to go to St。John's emergency…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,in case we got any walk-ins from the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got to find out a damage report。It's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bonwit Teller。Who the hell would want to blow up a department store？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you ever see a woman miss a shoe sale？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Connie，I want you to get started on a witness sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ricky，you and Joe，you make sure the uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,got it cordoned off there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you don't let the damn TV crews in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Benson！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector，phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Benson，traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get Fifth Avenue cleared up by 3：00 or we've got the traffic jam from hell！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter！I think you'd better take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Major Case Unit。Inspector Cobb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Said Simple Simon to the pie man，going to the fair…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Give me your pies or I'll cave your head in.」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Bonwits was just to make sure I had your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there a detective named McClane there？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's on suspension.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Walter，he's not。Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call me Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of game？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Simon Says.」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon's going to tell Lieutenant McClane what to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Lieutenant McClane is going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Noncompliance will result in a penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What penalty？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another big bang in a very public place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it that you want Lieutenant McClane to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon says Lieutenant McClane is to go to the corner of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,138th Street und Amsterdam…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,which is in Harlem if I'm not mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kowalski！Lambert！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know where to find McClane？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I kind of doubt you're gonna find him in church.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you better find out what rock he's under…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and kick it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,John.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me two more.Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，John，you look like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did we leave off with that roster？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we got three killings in Redhook the past two nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put Miner on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Genetti.The mayor's office will call before the day's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Next，14 dump trucks stolen from a yard in Staten Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fourteen。Jesus。What，somebody starting a construction company？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，that was John's landlady，going to clean his apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Insurance fraud。That's a priority out in California.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The contractor splits the money with the thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We had that out in Jersey a couple of years ago，Joe。Remember？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,See what Kelly can do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what was the lottery number last night？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You still betting your badge，Rick？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。6991，every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,6991。Lucky number.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Half the cops in New York play their badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are the kids，John？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you talk with Holly？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I didn't talk to Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coming up on it，Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hot in here or am I just scared to death？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to make sure the gun's secure？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you're the first woman
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,since Holly who's seen me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:06:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，so was she.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,So where's the backup gonna be？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna drop back to 128th Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten blocks？Are you fuckin' kiddin' me？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，that's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，hey，Walter，what is all this about，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we don't do what this guy says，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,he's gonna blow up another public place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，why me？What does he got to do with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no idea。He just said it had to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh。It's nice to be needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frankly，John…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Walter，how about you mind your fuckin' business about Holly，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and Simon are fuckin' up a perfectly good hangover.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be back to pick you up in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take your time。I expect to be dead in four.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，yo，Uncle！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's ten after 9：00。Why aren't you in school？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tony wants to sell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tony？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That no-neck dude they call Bad T？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says he found it in a Dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He keeps stealing from people，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.30,0:08:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,they're gonna find him in a Dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he didn't steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says his uncle gave it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm。Hand me that newspaper over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ever let people use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're running all over town with stolen property.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.80,0:08:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you get caught，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,you get in trouble…while he gets to deny the whole thing and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Y-You mean，you want us to take it back to Tony？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'll take it back to Tony，with a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，where you goin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,School.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,To get educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,So we can go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And why is that important？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,To get 'espect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Respect。Now，who's the bad guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys who sell drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys who have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who are the good guys？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's gonna help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:08:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So who's gonna help us？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna help ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.60,0:09:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who do we not want to help us？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,White people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now get on outta here。Go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle，you better come look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a white man standing in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dial 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell the police to get up here quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody's about to get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And get your butts to school，you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You havin' a nice day，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You feelin' all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to get too personal，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,but a white man standing in the middle of Harlem…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,wearin' a sign that says 「I hate niggers」…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,has either got some serious personal issues
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,or not all his dogs are barkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm talkin' to you！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you got about ten seconds before those guys see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when they do，they will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are about to have a very bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，this is a police matter。For your own safety
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a police matter！For your own safety…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suggest you hide your butt in my shop 'til the police get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on a case。Somebody blew up Bonwit Teller's an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you hear about that on the news？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The same asshole who did that…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,said I got to come to Harlem and do this…or he's gonna blow up something else。Do you understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit，shit，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.10,0:11:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I got a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They got ten guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you can get across the street，you should get across the street！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，start acting crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right？Like Looney Tunes。You know，like Bellevue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Zeus，this a friend of yours？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He look like a friend of mine？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think the dude just escaped from some hospital，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,you know，like Bellevue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am the voice of my own god，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and my god…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I told the librarian that I had a bad headache，but she didn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really do have a bad headache，though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a very bad headache！And my head does not feel…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，shut the fuck up！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've made a very bad mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut that shit off！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,In your face，boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fellas！Fellas！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nature boy here hates niggers.Now what are we gonna do about that？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:11:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold up，hold up，hold up！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back up！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hey，what you trippin' on？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back the fuck up now！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grab the cab！Grab the goddamn cab！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't shoot，huh？Don't shoot me！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up！Come on！Get up！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back up！I mean it！I don't want to，but I will！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know I will！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive！Drive！Drive！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Get the fuck outta here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive！Drive！Don't stop！Don't stop！Just keep drivin'！Run the red light！Drive，goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all I got！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put that fuckin' money away。Nobody's robbin' you，asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll fuckin' kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just run all the lights！Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got it，boss！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That cut deep？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,How the hell would I know？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keep pressure on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，fuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn。Jesus，right？John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn right you owe me！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got any idea what those guys are doing to my shop right now？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chill out，Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Chill out」？Are you trying to relate to me？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk like a white man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Jesus，I'm sorry you got involved，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you keep calling me 「Jesus」？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I look Puerto Rican to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guy back there called you 「Jesus，」 didn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He didn't say，「Jesus.」 He said，「Hey，Zeus.」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zeus？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Zeus！As in father of Apollo，Mount Olympus…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mount Olympus… Don't-fuck-with-me…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or-I'Il-shove-a-lightning-bolt-up-your-ass Zeus！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a problem with that？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I don't have a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Downtown。Police plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh-ho。Oh，that's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get a record of all his collars，recent releases…and list of anybody else he might have looked at sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's textbook megalomania。It's a pathological state…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,in which fantasies of control or omnipotence predominate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wants control over him。He wants control…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,over his actions，over his thoughts，even his emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.40,0:13:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like you got a secret admirer，John.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，maybe he'll send me some flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody knows you like pansies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not that kind of emotion。This guy is ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:13:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,How is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with him a shower wouldn't cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beer is normally taken internally，John.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me some aspirins，will you？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，okay。Hold this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Fred Schiller，John，and he's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A shrink。Yeah，I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。I was saying that we're dealing with a megalomaniacal personality…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,with possible paranoid schizophrenia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hey，how about we just skip down to the part…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,where you tell me what the fuck this has to do with me，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，what I do know is it does have specifically to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wants you to dance to his tune and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put on a dress and fuck me？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going to say，「kill you.」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's sitting on an awful lot of rage…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it could be manifested physically if he's stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody you arrested？Somebody you pissed off？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that could be one hell of a long list.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you，Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，these people don't like to work anonymously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They want you to know who's doing it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,So this name Simon is probably not an alias.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.90,0:14:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's probably Simon or some variation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon，Robert E。Busted in '86.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Extortion，kidnapping。Ten to fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did seven years for good behavior…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,released on a state work furlough two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bob Simons was a bankrupt businessman
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,who kidnapped his partner's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's a fuck-up not a psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guy we're looking for is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,A nut who knows a lot about bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We found this in a playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professional.Very cool stuff.You know，boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think you should slam it around like that，Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's unmixed。You can't hurt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,This stuff is cutting-edge。It's a binary liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,A what？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like epoxy。Two liquids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Either one by itself…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got nothing。But mix 'em…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie，you're gonna be wearin' that chair up your ass！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ Almighty，Charlie！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I said，very cool stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，with a package like this，you get a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，the bomb has to arm itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll see the red liquid pump
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,into the clear before it detonates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long before？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten seconds。Two minutes。Could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,But once it's mixed，be somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This stuff has got to be pretty rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We ought to be able to find out if any of it's missing somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Livermore Labs。Theft over the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has he got enough to make another one，Joe？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,About 2，000 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of that？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，the detonating mechanism can be anything：
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Radio，electrical.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell，you could use a beeper and phone it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector！Inspector，it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got a double Alberti feedback loop on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,A nasty little trick I believe once used in Lebanon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.40,0:16:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie。Charlie！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie，shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Want to start the trace？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wore the board，walked the street and survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hauptman Walter，where are my pigeons now？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Pigeons」？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had two pigeons，bright and gay，fly from me the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why was it they did go？You cannot tell，you do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.30,0:17:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean McClane？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I mean Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，there after all。And your friend？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carver！Carver！Come on。We need you in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They need you。Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，he's here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And may I speak with him？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，is the ebony Samaritan there now？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a problem with ebony？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。My only problem is that I went to some
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,trouble preparing that game for McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You interfered with a well-laid plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？Well，you can stick your well-laid plan up your well-laid ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was not smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are lives at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not enough time，Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You better hope he calls back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ricky，you want to tell those people to shut the hell up out there！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Keep it down here！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon。He wasn't speaking for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was unpleasant。Don't let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's your name，boy？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't call me 「boy」！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。It was a poor attempt at humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going to send you home with a chiding…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.40,0:18:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,but now I think perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,you should join the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got him！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a pay phone in，in Oslo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，w-wait，they say it's Juarez，Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait。No，wait。N-Now they're saying it's Juarez，Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget it！Australia？He's scrambling up their system.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,They don't know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Having fun with the phone company，are we？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon says McClane and the Samaritan…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,will go to the subway station at 72nd and Broadway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will call you in 15 minutes on the pay phone outside the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No police。Failure to answer will constitute noncompliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you understand me，John？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes，I understand。I understand that you're a fuckin' whacko that likes to play kids' games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Hardly」？Well，then，who are you？Somebody I sent up？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What'd you do？Shoplifting？Purse-snatching？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cross-dressing？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You c-c-couldn't catch me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,if I stole your ch-chair with you in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,My ch-ch-ch-chair with me in it？Ooh！That's very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me ask you a question，bonehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to k-k-k-k-kill me？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，John，calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？Why don't you come on down here to police plaza…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we'll figure this out like a couple of men，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,So come on down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,If killing you was all I wanted…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon.I can appreciate your feelings for McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，believe me，the jerk isn't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's stepped on so many toes in this department…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,by this time next month，he's gonna be a security guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,His own wife wants nothing to do with him…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he's about two steps shy of becoming a full-blown alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,One step。One step.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now listen to me。You sound like a real smart guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it that you want？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you talking about money？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，whatever，whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane is a toilet bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，what would it take just to forget him and live happily ever after？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，money is shit to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would not give up McClane
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,for all the gold in your Fort Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,72nd Street subway。Pay phone。15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane and the Samaritan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're competent in the least，you found the briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you know what I mean by penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to thank you for that vote of confidence，Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I thought it was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This guy's a raving maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he couldn't be any clearer if you got it from a case history.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He gave you clues to his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He spoke German，he called it 「your Fort Knox」…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he stammered when McClane pushed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you believe this guy really can't be bought？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no chance。And the very mention of money only enraged him further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you asking me to be a cop again，Walter？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.00,0:21:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ricky，get him his gun…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joe，this time they…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't answer my question，Walter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you done，Lieutenant？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you two better get going if you're gonna get up to 72nd Street on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joe，this time they go with backup！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got it！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，whoa！I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon says you gotta go！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not jumping through hoops for some psycho！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a white man with white problems。You deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.10,0:21:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call me when he crosses 110th Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Why'd you save my ass？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I stopped a white cop from gettin' killed in Harlem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,One white cop gets killed today，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.60,0:22:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,tomorrow we got a thousand white cops…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,all of 'em with itchy trigger fingers。Got it？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie，where'd you find that bomb？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chinatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.60,0:22:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zeus！Yo，partner！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait up！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hey，I ain't your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ain't your neighbor，your brother or your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm your total stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，stranger。Know where that park is at 115th Street
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and St。Nicholas？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's in Harlem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where do you think we found that bomb？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，this guy doesn't care about skin color，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,even if you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What am I doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cheer up。Things could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.80,0:22:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was working on a nice，fat suspension…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,smoking cigarettes and watching Captain Kangaroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，they made it to the phone，but there's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what do you mean？How big a problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，about 300 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，We need this phone for official police business.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Honey，I'm a cop。I need the phone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off the damn phone，lady！Police business！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I never！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can find a phone across the street，ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get something straight。I'm the only one here on official police business.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.90,0:23:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ever do that shit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get something else straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need me a lot more than I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't like the way I do things？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.90,0:23:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，I need you more than you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Birds of a feather flock together，so do pigs and swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.70,0:24:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rats and mice have their chance as will I have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice。It rhymes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why was the phone busy？Who were you calling？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Psychic Hot Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd advise you to take this more seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it's a public phone！What do you want me to say？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can simply say there was a fat woman on it，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.60,0:24:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it took you a minute to get her off！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，John，there's a significant amount of explosive in the trash receptacle next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try to run and it goes up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.30,0:24:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，nobody's gonna run，but I got a hundred people out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.20,0:24:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，do I have your attention？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.50,0:24:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I was going to St。Ives，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I met a man with seven wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every wife had seven sacks，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,every sack had seven cats，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.90,0:24:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,every cat had seven kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kittens，cats，sacks and wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many were going to St。Ives？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,My phone number is 555…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，wait！I didn't get all that！Say it again！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.00,0:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a chance。My phone number is 555…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.30,0:24:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the answer。Call me in 30 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.80,0:25:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，seven guys with seven wives is…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up，McClane。I'm good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seven guys and seven wives…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut the fuck up，McClane！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said seven wives with seven sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.10,0:25:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seven times seven is 49。Now tell me the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.50,0:25:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，a sack with s-seven，seven，seven…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck is wrong with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.90,0:25:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，Besides having a bad fuckin' hangover，for one thing！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right，all right！Seven wives times seven，49.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.40,0:25:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,With seven cats… Seven times 49 is 343，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.90,0:25:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，are you asking me or telling me？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm telling you。343 times seven is…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.50,0:25:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，zero，24.2，401。That's what you got，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.30,0:25:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。Dial。555-2401.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait，wait！It's a trick！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.10,0:25:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.50,0:25:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I forgot about the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.60,0:25:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What man？Fuck the man！We got ten seconds here！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said how many were going to St。Ives，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The riddle begins，「As I was going to St。Ives，I met a man with seven wives.」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.20,0:25:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guy and his wives aren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.10,0:25:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are they doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.20,0:25:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sittin' in the fuckin' road，waitin' on the moon！How the hell should I know，McClane！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，who was going to St。Ives then？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.00,0:26:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guy。Just the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just one guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.20,0:26:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The answer's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just one guy。How do you dial 「one」？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.70,0:26:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,555-0001.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,0001。Just one guy's goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.40,0:26:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，John.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，a piece of cake。Give us something harder next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you're ten seconds late.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.10,0:26:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！The answer is one！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.70,0:26:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a bomb in the trash can！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody get down！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.70,0:26:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a bomb！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.10,0:26:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。You can have it。Come on。Come on。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.40,0:26:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.30,0:27:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't say，「Simon says.」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.00,0:27:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's 9：50，John.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Number Three train is arriving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I left something provocative on that train，John.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.30,0:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon says get to the pay phone next to the news kiosk…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.30,0:27:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,in Wall Street Station by 10：20…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.40,0:27:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or the Number Three train and its passengers vaporize.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use any means of travel other than civilian
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.40,0:27:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I blow the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.20,0:27:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attempt to evacuate the subway，I blow the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.00,0:27:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I call you in 30 minutes。Be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.10,0:27:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.00,0:27:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,90 blocks in 30 minutes in New York traffic？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It could be double that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.50,0:27:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't even have a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.10,0:27:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Sir！I'm a cop.I am requisitioning this car for official police business！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.30,0:27:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you doing？My cab！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.00,0:27:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in！Get in！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I used to drive a cab。The fastest way south is…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What were you saying？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was saying，I used to drive a cab…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.70,0:28:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Ninth Avenue is the fastest way south.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.50,0:28:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we seem to be going east.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.80,0:28:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you going，McClane？I told you Ninth Avenue…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.90,0:28:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop with the goddamn yelling！I know what I'm doing！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.10,0:28:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not even God knows what you're doing！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.30,0:28:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're headed east on 72nd towards the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.60,0:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Wall Street is south！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，stop yelling at me！I got a bad headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.40,0:28:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the best way south is not Ninth Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's through the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.10,0:28:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you the Park Drive was always jammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't say Park Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，「through the park.」
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.40,0:28:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！We lost them。They're in the park，headed south.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.40,0:28:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.90,0:28:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crazy prick！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got him，Connie。He's taking the scenic route.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.90,0:29:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Outta the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.00,0:29:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！Get outta there！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.60,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch it！Watch out！Are you aiming for these people？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.40,0:29:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.80,0:29:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe that mime.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.10,0:29:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tree！Tree！Tree！Haul！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.80,0:29:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on here？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.10,0:29:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tree！Tree！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.50,0:29:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.50,0:29:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Broads！Rock，rock！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.40,0:29:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look out down there！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.50,0:30:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.90,0:30:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Outta the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.40,0:30:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do Catholics do that thing？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,North，south，west，east.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.00,0:30:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much time？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.10,0:30:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha！72nd and Broadway…to Central Park South in three minutes！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's gotta be a fuckin' record！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Now what？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we need a fire truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.80,0:30:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.80,0:30:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,To follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.10,0:30:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 911。- Lieutenant John McClane，NYPD…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,access number 7479，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.50,0:30:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,calling from a civilian transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.60,0:30:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get me an emergency dispatcher right away！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.10,0:30:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got two officers down at the corner of 14th Street and Ninth Avenue！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.60,0:30:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Need an ambulance！Over！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.10,0:30:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most of the calls on the west side go to Roosevelt Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.40,0:30:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's two blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.80,0:31:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slow the fuck down，McClane！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.80,0:31:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kind of like football，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.70,0:31:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get yourself a blocker and head for the end zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.40,0:31:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you'd said Wall Street，we could have followed him all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.50,0:31:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wrong。South of 14th Street's a different hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.90,0:31:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Saint Luke's。Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.50,0:31:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,10：02。We're halfway there with 18 minutes to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.10,0:32:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck this。Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.20,0:32:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on。Hang on！Hang on！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slide over and take the wheel！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.00,0:32:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you goin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should be ahead of that train，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.10,0:32:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're not gonna…get on that train！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.20,0:32:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get on that train！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta get to that pay phone by 10：20.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.30,0:32:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get that bomb！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.60,0:32:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，you fail，I cover your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.10,0:32:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fail，you cover my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.30,0:32:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if we both fail？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.10,0:32:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then we're both fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.10,0:32:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，now！Drive！Get to that phone booth by 10：20！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,My lucky fuckin' day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get outta the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.70,0:32:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a bad idea！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.30,0:33:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me！Excuse me！Just get outta the way，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,112 Wall Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,this isn't a taxi。You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your light's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.70,0:33:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll make it simple。112 Wall Street，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.30,0:33:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,or I'll have your medallion suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You don't like white people？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.80,0:34:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,112 Wall Street。You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.70,0:34:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move your legs here。Get your legs outta the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.90,0:34:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:34:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.10,0:35:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，sir。Pardon me，please。Excuse…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.20,0:35:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you step outta here for a minute？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.00,0:35:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a cop。Step outta here for a minute，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，please！Can I get through here，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.50,0:35:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.00,0:35:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，sir，but I'm expecting a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.00,0:35:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.60,0:35:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you use the other phone？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.00,0:36:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，please。I need to use that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.50,0:36:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen，bro，I was here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Bro」？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.50,0:36:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get away from the goddamn phone！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.60,0:36:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your hands up！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.10,0:36:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to answer that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.40,0:36:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just shut up and get 'em in the air！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.20,0:36:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch it！Excuse me！Pardon me！Watch it。Watch your back。Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.80,0:36:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen，I'm a New York police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.00,0:36:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ask you to calmly and quietly start moving towards the other end of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.40,0:36:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go now，please。Go now。Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.10,0:36:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Hurry！Watch out！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.90,0:36:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch。Watch it。Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.20,0:36:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to answer that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.20,0:36:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.40,0:37:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，if you have to shoot me…then you go ahead and you shoot me！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.90,0:37:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I have to answer this phone！All right？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.70,0:37:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.70,0:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And McClane？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's on his way。You know，he's a little slow。He's kind of out of shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rules applied to both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this is noncompliance。Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.70,0:37:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.60,0:37:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.00,0:38:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，get outta there！Get outta there！Duck，asshole！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.30,0:39:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.70,0:39:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.60,0:39:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can see right down into the subway.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.80,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many fire trucks you count？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.00,0:39:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys，you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.00,0:39:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can you see from up there？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.90,0:39:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn。Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.90,0:39:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Officer，tell those people to get the hell back，will you？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.00,0:39:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a shitload of cuts and bruises，a couple concussions…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.70,0:39:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,some old guy's pacemaker stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.20,0:39:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a pregnant girl's water broke，and that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.80,0:39:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doin'，John？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.80,0:39:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still can't hear too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's a miracle you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.40,0:39:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's the problem，Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.90,0:39:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.90,0:39:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The miracle part.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.60,0:39:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are the odds of us making it down here on time？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hmm。Zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.80,0:40:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That bomb was gonna go off no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wanted it to go off right down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.80,0:40:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take this off me，Dave.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what's so special about this place？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.70,0:40:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Something just doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.50,0:40:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant McClane？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.60,0:40:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're asking for you and a Mr.Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.40,0:40:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.50,0:40:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,John.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.00,0:40:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，this is Andy Cross
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.90,0:40:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.30,0:40:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Bill Jarvis。He's，uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.70,0:40:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm，uh，with another agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.90,0:40:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Lieutenant McClane。This is Mr.Carver.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.30,0:40:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，we got a couple questions first.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.50,0:40:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You recognize this guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.80,0:40:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.90,0:40:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about this one？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.20,0:40:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about you？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.30,0:40:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you recognize the voice on the phone？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.30,0:41:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you，uh，noticed any cars following you around？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.10,0:41:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.40,0:41:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anybody following you at all？Any kind of surveillance？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.80,0:41:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Telephone？House？Anything unusual at all？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.80,0:41:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now that you mention it…I have experienced a，
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,you know，like a burning sensation between my toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We read your jacket，Lieutenant。We were told you would be cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.40,0:41:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cooperate with what？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.30,0:41:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，now，wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.40,0:41:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're just wasting time here in this goddamn van.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.60,0:41:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to share…information，how about sending a little our way as well？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.90,0:41:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we want to hear what he knows first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.30,0:41:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You give us pictures，and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.80,0:41:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we want to hear…what he knows first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.50,0:41:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I know as much as you know，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.10,0:41:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a guy out there settin' off bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.90,0:41:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He calls himself Simon。He speaks with a German accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.80,0:41:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，for some reason，he's very angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.80,0:42:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now maybe you can tell me why，fellas，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.70,0:42:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first man there is Matthias Targo：
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.10,0:42:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was Hungarian Army，explosives expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.10,0:42:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we believe he's working for the Iranians.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.60,0:42:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Working」？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.70,0:42:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freelance terrorism，by contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.30,0:42:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's the girl？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.10,0:42:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Targo's other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rumor is the Israelis slipped a bomb in between their sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.00,0:42:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，he wasn't at home，but they think maybe they got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.80,0:42:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second man was an obscure colonel in the East German Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.20,0:42:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He ran an infiltration unit; the kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.30,0:42:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Nazis did at the Battle of the Bulge.English-speaking troops…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.60,0:42:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，l-I saw the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.00,0:42:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,All we know of him is GDR medical records show he suffers from migraines.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.30,0:42:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,His name is Peter Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.50,0:42:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that is an exceptional report，fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.20,0:42:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now do you want to tell me what the hell this has to do with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.80,0:43:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The name Gruber mean anything to you，Lieutenant？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It rings a bell，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.70,0:43:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,L.A。That thing in the building in L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.60,0:43:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Peter Krieg was born Simon Peter Gruber.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.70,0:43:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's Hans Gruber's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.10,0:43:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's that thing in L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.40,0:43:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We figure he's got you fitted up for a toe tag and he's gonna do anything to get it tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.40,0:43:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector！Inspector，it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.10,0:43:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let him know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.70,0:43:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.00,0:43:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector。Now，who from the FBI is in the van，I wonder？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.60,0:43:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see，almost certainly Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:43:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Andrew，say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.00,0:44:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.60,0:44:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know you never run alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.30,0:44:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,So say hello，Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.20,0:44:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still trying to butch up by chewing on your glasses，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.40,0:44:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,This，gentlemen，as they say，is where the plot thickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.10,0:44:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have put 2，400 pounds of explosive
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.70,0:44:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,in one of the 1，446 schools in greater New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.00,0:44:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is fitted with a timer set to explode at exactly 3：00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.90,0:44:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Your silence says I'm understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.40,0:44:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you say 2，400 pounds？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.20,0:44:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，but please don't interrupt again！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.40,0:44:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon says if you attempt to evacuate schools…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.60,0:44:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,the bomb will be detonated by radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.30,0:44:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，gentlemen，someone will be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.70,0:44:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Repeat：One school will be dismissed at 3：00 p.m.，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,permanently，unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.40,0:44:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless what？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.50,0:44:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unless John McClane and his new best friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.70,0:44:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,complete the tasks I set them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.70,0:44:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，are you listening？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.50,0:44:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The pay phone beyond Hope Thompkins Square Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.00,0:45:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty minutes。Go by foot。No rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're really clever，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.40,0:45:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,you'll learn the location of the bomb and the code to disarm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.00,0:45:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and by the way，gentlemen，we got something of a bargain on radio detonators.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.40,0:45:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only problem is，the darn things seem to respond to police and FBI frequencies…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.10,0:45:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,so if I were you，I'd keep off your radios.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.50,0:45:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon，wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.60,0:45:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,2，400 pounds of that liquid stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.00,0:45:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,My God！Get me the commissioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.30,0:45:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's doing a press conference。He's supposed to be here in half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.10,0:45:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Ricky，get every senior officer on the site。Get 'em here right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.30,0:45:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not gonna give me any jurisdictional nonsense on this？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.70,0:45:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got two kids in the school on 64th Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.70,0:45:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What can I do to help you？- How many men have you got？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.80,0:45:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventy-five，but if I push the panic button，
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.90,0:45:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can get 500 from Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.30,0:45:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,When？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.30,0:45:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,2：30，3：00.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.70,0:45:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Between now and then？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.00,0:45:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to do this all by ourselves。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.40,0:46:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，Thompkins Square Park is more than two miles away，so you guys better get running.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.80,0:46:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No radios。You take my telephone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.90,0:46:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get anything，you call me through the switchboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.50,0:46:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.60,0:46:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks。Find that bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.80,0:46:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ricky，where are they？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.00,0:46:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.00,0:46:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Senior man present is Chief Allen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.90,0:46:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chief of what？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.70,0:46:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，thanks，Ricky。Gentlemen，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.10,0:46:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,we have a decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.30,0:46:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chief Allen，the man who has done this has told us that
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.10,0:46:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,he has planted another very large bomb in a school here in the New York area.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.80,0:46:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he has told us that we cannot evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.30,0:46:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he has not said that we cannot search.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I recommend we get everybody，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.20,0:46:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I mean everybody…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm talking about police，transit，sanitation，fire，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.10,0:46:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,even the goddamn librarians…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.70,0:46:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we start searching schools，and I mean right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.70,0:46:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm talking about a thousand buildings within the city limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.40,0:46:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we have three hours and 15 minutes to do it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.20,0:46:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I'd like to keep the media out of this as long as possible…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.20,0:46:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,because if they get in，we've got a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.20,0:46:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we in agreement？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.10,0:47:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，come on，guys！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.20,0:47:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.80,0:47:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.90,0:47:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hook，line…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.60,0:47:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.60,0:47:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right now，men，let's go！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.20,0:48:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sergeant Turley！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.80,0:48:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the last five minutes，the volume of calls in here has tripled.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.90,0:48:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell is goin' on？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.60,0:48:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.60,0:48:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,For the rest of the day，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.70,0:48:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're supposed to handle the department's communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean，「handle」？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're shutting down the police band。All calls will be coming through this switchboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.40,0:48:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna marry Donald Trump.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.60,0:48:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walsh，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why'd everybody tear out of here？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.20,0:48:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Pamela，look at your watch。It's comin' up on shift change.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.90,0:48:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bean counters are worried about overtime…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.80,0:49:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,so we sent everybody back to the precinct to punch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.70,0:49:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The next shift is gonna be here in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.20,0:49:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are so full of shit，Walsh！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.80,0:49:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.60,0:49:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.70,0:49:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective。Bob Thompson，City Engineer's Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.50,0:49:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd like to get an idea of the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，you guys really got here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.40,0:49:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，it's Wall Street，sir。Lot of money here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.60,0:49:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lot of opinion makers
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.00,0:49:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,the mayor doesn't want to piss off，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.10,0:49:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.40,0:50:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy Toledo！Somebody had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.60,0:50:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you'd show my associates the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.70,0:50:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.30,0:50:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jimmy！You got the flashlight？Murphy！Come on！You too！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.50,0:50:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rick Walsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.80,0:50:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,John Cochran.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.00,0:50:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，gentlemen。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.80,0:50:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were probably at the World Trades.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what that mess was.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.70,0:51:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please inform Mr.Little that Mr.Vanderfloog is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr.Vanderfloog？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.90,0:51:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a Mr.Vanderfloog for Mr.Little.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.40,0:51:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go down 20 meters！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.00,0:51:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lot of steam down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.10,0:51:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we snapped a couple of the steam pipes.It's like a sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.20,0:51:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got the subway guys to shut down the third rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.10,0:51:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some emergency lights？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.00,0:51:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，emergency lights，and there's still some light…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.70,0:51:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No shooting！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.80,0:51:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speak English！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.70,0:51:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Otto doesn't speak English，do you，Otto？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.20,0:51:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where the hell did we get this guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.40,0:51:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's one of Targo's thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.90,0:51:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on。Pull all the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what was up with this L.A。Thing？You famous or something？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.50,0:52:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，for about five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.80,0:52:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't tell me。Rodney King，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.20,0:52:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.50,0:52:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know this guy Simon we're talking to？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.20,0:52:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I threw his little brother off the 32nd floor of Nakatomi Towers out in L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.70,0:52:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess he's a little pissed off about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.60,0:52:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。You mean to tell me I'm in this shit…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.60,0:52:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,'cause some white cop threw
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.80,0:52:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,some white asshole's brother off a roof？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.60,0:53:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr.Vanderfloog？Felix Little，Corporate Relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.20,0:53:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry you had to wait，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.10,0:53:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but apparently there was an explosion in the subway.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.10,0:53:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's played hell with our alarms，I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.40,0:53:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I trust there's nothing wron
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.80,0:53:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。Good lord，no。Safe and secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.90,0:53:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you were concerned about a currency exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.10,0:53:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，we are not a commercial bank in the normal sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.20,0:53:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're primarily，governments，central banks，that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.00,0:53:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Apart from the depository，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.00,0:53:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.40,0:53:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you are in the flower business，Mr.Vanderfloog？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.20,0:54:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，Mr.Vanderfloog，that's the vault elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.30,0:54:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.60,0:54:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's against… Our alarms are sonic and seismic…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.60,0:54:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,two things，which，I'm afraid，do not react well to explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.10,0:54:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，this，this subway business has knocked all our systems into a cocked hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.70,0:54:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,In fact，we've had to give up and pull the plug on the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.70,0:54:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The repair people are downstairs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.60,0:54:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good lord！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.60,0:54:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.80,0:54:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heavens to Betsy！If anyone knew！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.60,0:54:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I thought this was a currency exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.40,0:55:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I think we go straight to the withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.50,0:55:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Captain，you want to come down here…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.30,0:55:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and take a look at this？Something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.90,0:55:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you think，guys？Will you be able to fix that？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.60,0:56:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just a minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.50,0:56:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.70,0:56:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.60,0:56:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay back！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.30,0:56:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay back！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.40,0:56:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.50,0:57:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，front desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.50,0:57:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your ass down here right now！I'm under attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.30,0:57:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，just relax，mate。Maybe you'll live through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.40,0:57:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.30,0:57:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he's dead，my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.30,0:57:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，see to the office workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.90,0:57:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's being done，Herr.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.10,0:58:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,140 billion dollars！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.20,0:58:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten times what's in Kentucky！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.20,0:58:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fort Knox！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.00,0:58:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha！It's for tourists！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.40,0:58:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.90,0:58:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，you out of shape？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.80,0:58:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You barely made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.40,0:58:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，we all barely make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.50,0:58:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want us to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.00,0:59:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What has four legs and is always ready to travel？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.00,0:59:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？What？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.70,0:59:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What'd he say？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.80,0:59:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What has four legs and is always ready to travel？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.90,0:59:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you？Don't you have kids？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.20,0:59:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's an elephant joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.80,0:59:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa。That a bomb？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.00,0:59:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，just go ahead and grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.60,0:59:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you're the cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.10,0:59:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon said you're supposed to be helping with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.80,0:59:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm helpin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.90,0:59:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，when you gonna start helpin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.00,0:59:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,After you get the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.50,0:59:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.10,0:59:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm being careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.30,0:59:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't open it！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.10,0:59:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.20,0:59:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.00,0:59:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.20,1:00:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Shit！I told you not to open it！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.70,1:00:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I trust you see the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.10,1:00:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has a proximity circuit，so，please，don't run.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.50,1:00:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I got it。We're not gonna run.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.30,1:00:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do we turn this thing off？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.00,1:00:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the fountain there should be two jugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.20,1:00:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you see them？A five-gallon and a three-gallon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.90,1:00:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fill one of the jugs with exactly four gallons of water…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.40,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,and place it on the scale，and the timer will stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.60,1:00:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,ou must be precise。One ounce more or less will result in detonation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.10,1:00:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're still alive in five minutes，we'll speak again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.20,1:00:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！Wait a second！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.80,1:00:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't get it。Do you get it？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.10,1:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.20,1:00:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the jugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.60,1:01:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obviously，we can't fill the three-gallon jug with four gallons of water，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.00,1:01:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.80,1:01:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，I know。Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.00,1:01:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We fill the three-gallon jug exactly to the top，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.00,1:01:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，now，we pour that three gallons into the five-gallon jug…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.20,1:01:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,giving us exactly three gallons in the five-gallon jug，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.10,1:01:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Then what？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.10,1:01:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，we take…the three-gallon jug，we fill that a third of the way up…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.40,1:01:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no，he said be precise.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.70,1:01:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every cop in 15 miles is runnin' his ass off，and I'm out here playin' kids' games in the park！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.50,1:01:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！You wanna focus on the problem at hand？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.20,1:01:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you said you knew！You said don't say anything if you don't know！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.70,1:01:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you said… Give me the fuckin' jug！We're starting over.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.10,1:01:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，we can't start over.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.50,1:01:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put my foot up your ass，you dumb mother…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.00,1:01:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say it！Say it！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.50,1:02:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were gonna call me a 「nigger，」 weren't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.90,1:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.80,1:02:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，you were！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.50,1:02:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What were you gonna call me？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.40,1:02:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Asshole！How's that，asshole？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.20,1:02:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got some fuckin' problem with me because I'm white，Zeus？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.30,1:02:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that it，huh？Have I oppressed you？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.40,1:02:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have I oppressed your people somehow？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.20,1:02:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what your problem is，you don't like me 'cause…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.30,1:02:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a racist！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.00,1:02:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.70,1:02:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a racist！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.50,1:02:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't like me 'cause I'm white！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.60,1:02:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like you because you're gonna get me killed！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.50,1:02:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much time？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.60,1:02:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！We got less than a minute！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.00,1:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Throw this thing away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.80,1:02:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we can't take it off of there。It'll detonate.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.60,1:02:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just wait。Wait a second，wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.40,1:02:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got it，I got it！Exactly two gallons in here，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.90,1:02:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.60,1:02:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leaving exactly one gallon of empty space，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.40,1:02:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.20,1:02:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,A full five gallons here，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.60,1:02:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You pour one gallon out of the five gallons into there…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.90,1:02:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,we have exactly four gallons in there！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.40,1:02:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pour it in there！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.60,1:02:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.80,1:02:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't spill！Don't spill it！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.40,1:02:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good，good，good！Exactly four gallons！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.30,1:02:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You did it，McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.20,1:02:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it on the thing！Get it down there！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.50,1:02:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.00,1:03:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations。You're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.90,1:03:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.50,1:03:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.70,1:03:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You surprised me again，John.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.10,1:03:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is becoming an ugly habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.20,1:03:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，I don't have the time right now，Simon。Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.50,1:03:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A deal's a deal。Where's the school bomb？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.90,1:03:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the contrary，you have lots of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.00,1:03:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.30,1:03:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,two hours and 47 minutes，precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.50,1:03:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plenty of time to test those wits of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.60,1:03:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen，jerk-off！Let me tell you something！I got a bad fuckin' hangover，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.30,1:03:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm a little sick of these fuckin' riddles！Now，where is the school bomb？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.10,1:03:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Temper，John。The road to truth has many turns.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.80,1:03:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will find an envelope under the rim of the fountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.30,1:03:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you undertake the trip it suggests…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.90,1:03:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,ask yourself this question：
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.90,1:03:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is 21 out of 42？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.50,1:03:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.50,1:03:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should abandon the rest and go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.20,1:04:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Relax，Targo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.50,1:04:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's not a cop for 20 blocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.50,1:04:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's sending us to the home-team dugout at Yankee Stadium。Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.30,1:04:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we're the home team。We supposed to find something there？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.50,1:04:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's 21 out of 42？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.60,1:04:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,21 again。Half of 42。42 what？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.10,1:04:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many players are on the Yankees ball club？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.70,1:04:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-five.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.10,1:04:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What else is 21？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.60,1:04:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blackjack.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.30,1:04:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a club.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.10,1:04:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a wild-goose chase，is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.30,1:04:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is the nearest A train？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.70,1:04:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait，wait，wait，wait。You know，some kid might find that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.40,1:04:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.80,1:04:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come back here！You little sons of bitches！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.40,1:04:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remember you！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.40,1:04:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，where you going？Come here。What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.70,1:04:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't！Let me go，dick-head！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.20,1:04:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.90,1:04:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to go down to juvenile hall for a Butterfinger？Is that it？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.00,1:05:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look around，man。All the cops are into something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.00,1:05:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Christmas！You could steal City Hall！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.50,1:05:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.00,1:05:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，that's my bike！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.90,1:05:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you going？Yankee Stadium's that way！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.00,1:05:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's my bike，you asshole！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.70,1:05:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you just run over everybody in the whole street？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.80,1:05:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.00,1:05:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,what the fuck are we doing back down here？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.30,1:05:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.70,1:05:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it that Wall Street doesn't have？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.30,1:05:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，is this stuff catching？You're talkin' in riddles！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.10,1:05:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，stay with me。What is it that Wall Street does not have？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.60,1:05:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.40,1:05:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Schools.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.30,1:05:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what is it they have a shitload of？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.20,1:05:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.70,1:05:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.40,1:05:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do with this？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.90,1:06:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give it to those guys over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.70,1:06:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.10,1:06:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you could be a little more specific.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.30,1:06:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane is here。He's walking toward the bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.50,1:06:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The black man is coming toward me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.10,1:06:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，now，that's a pity.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.10,1:06:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And after we'd gone to all that trouble at the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.60,1:06:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon，kill him。Stop toying with him，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.40,1:06:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,and kill him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.60,1:06:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，so be it。May he rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.70,1:06:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll inform Karl in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.20,1:06:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You pack up your team and get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.10,1:06:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this one？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.30,1:06:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Officer？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.40,1:06:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm I'm afraid I'm going to need an answer on that issue.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.30,1:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.70,1:06:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.00,1:06:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.20,1:06:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,John McClane says to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.40,1:06:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait。Jesus，don't open it。It's a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.20,1:06:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.60,1:07:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Oh，I see。Um，oh，we'll take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.60,1:07:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd better move now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.60,1:07:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，thank you so much for your assistance。We really appreciate it。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.90,1:07:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！You，you，uh，leaving this place unguarded？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.30,1:07:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.50,1:07:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.10,1:07:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,John McClane，NYPD.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.90,1:07:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.00,1:08:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Laundry day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.40,1:08:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What can I do for you，Lieutenant？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.70,1:08:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has it been quiet like this all morning here？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.50,1:08:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except for that big explosion a couple of hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.90,1:08:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，have you seen anything strange happen in the last hour or so？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.10,1:08:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.00,1:08:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we've had cops in here pretty steady
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.10,1:08:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,since the subway thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.30,1:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were just gonna make a round on the vault floor…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.10,1:08:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you want to tag along.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.30,1:08:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure，yeah，
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.10,1:08:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,that's… Think I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.20,1:08:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，what do you think of this heat this late in the year？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.60,1:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Indian summer，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.30,1:08:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，feels like it's gonna rain like dogs and cats later.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.90,1:08:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's one of your guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.30,1:08:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective，uh，Otto，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.20,1:08:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.90,1:08:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Mike，how you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.90,1:08:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I keep telling myself I'm gonna take the stairs just for the exercise…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.90,1:08:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,but on a hot day like this…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.10,1:08:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it seems like I always end up riding the lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.90,1:09:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what was the lottery number last night？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.80,1:09:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？You guys play the lottery？No？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.40,1:09:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，my wife buys me two tickets every week，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.70,1:09:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,for the last ten years。Plays the same two numbers all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.10,1:09:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say，「Honey，why don't you play a different number？」
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.10,1:09:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,She goes，「Well，those are my lucky numbers.」
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.40,1:09:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got the tickets right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.60,1:09:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put that fucking gun down！Put the fucking gun down now！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it down！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.80,1:10:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello！Anybody down here？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.20,1:10:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put your hands up！Put your fucking hands up now！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.40,1:10:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！No，John，no！No！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.30,1:10:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ，you almost gave me a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.10,1:10:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.60,1:10:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.00,1:10:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，it's not my blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.40,1:10:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on down here？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.30,1:10:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go take a look in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.30,1:10:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，McClane，where the hell is everybody？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.00,1:10:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon fuckin' says！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.60,1:11:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should've seen it coming a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.30,1:11:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,This was never about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.70,1:11:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's about a goddamn heist！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.50,1:11:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But wh… what was in the room？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.10,1:11:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.60,1:11:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.70,1:11:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！Is this gold？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.50,1:11:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.40,1:11:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn，this is heavy！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.80,1:11:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,hey cleaned out a whole room of this？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.30,1:11:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.00,1:11:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，that would've taken，like，a-a-a-a tank…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.60,1:11:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A dump truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.00,1:11:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fourteen great big dump trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.30,1:11:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We almost got hit by a dump truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.30,1:11:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.70,1:11:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！Slow down！Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.30,1:11:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put that shit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.50,1:11:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.40,1:11:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They ain't gonna let you keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.50,1:11:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.70,1:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna need a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,A car？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.70,1:11:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know how to hot-wire this thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.20,1:11:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I can。I'm an electrician.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.40,1:11:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only problem is…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.00,1:11:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,it takes too fucking long.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.30,1:12:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not on the bridge！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.60,1:12:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down there，McClane！The FDR！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.40,1:12:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！Let's go！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.00,1:12:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.90,1:12:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.40,1:12:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,They shot the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.60,1:12:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.20,1:12:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，what's 21 out of 42？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.90,1:12:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.00,1:12:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what about Yankee Stadium？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.00,1:12:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll get there…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,but that son of a bitch is not getting off of Manhattan！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.90,1:12:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.00,1:12:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ！Who do you think you are，lady？Hillary Clinton？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.80,1:12:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it！Hillary Clinton！The 42nd president！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.90,1:12:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，she'd be the 43rd president.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.40,1:12:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，all right，but who's the 21st？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.90,1:12:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，l…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.70,1:12:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.40,1:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I don't know。Do you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.70,1:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.80,1:12:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of engine's this piece of shit have？Come on。Step on it！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.10,1:12:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just a Yugo！It's built for economy not speed！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.60,1:12:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.90,1:12:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to get us another phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.60,1:13:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，wait，wait！Wait，wait，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.00,1:13:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，who was the 21st president？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go fuck yourself！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.70,1:13:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That guy was pissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.80,1:13:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll feel better when he looks in the back seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.50,1:13:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！That was my gold bar！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.70,1:13:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is McClane。Get me Inspector Walter Cobb.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.30,1:13:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，where the hell are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.80,1:13:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter，it's not a revenge！It's a heist！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.60,1:13:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.50,1:13:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's gold in the Federal Reserve…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.10,1:13:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they took a shitload of it！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.40,1:13:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're headed north in dump trucks！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.10,1:13:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you been drinking，McClane？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.00,1:13:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.80,1:13:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，there's a line of dump trucks northbound on the FDR at about 70th Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.10,1:13:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ought to close the bridge and then get some helicopters over there right away！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.90,1:13:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't close a hot dog stand right now！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.50,1:13:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm spread all over hell！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.40,1:13:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about this damn bomb？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.20,1:13:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find out who the 21st president was.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.80,1:13:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's got something to do with this！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.80,1:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,John？John，the 21st what？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.80,1:13:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.90,1:13:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Goddamn cellular fuckin' phones！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.90,1:13:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get hold of Munsen in Triborough.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.80,1:13:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell him to close all the East River bridges north of 59th Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.00,1:13:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looking for dump trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.90,1:13:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dump trucks？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.10,1:13:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane says…there are dump trucks headed up the FDR
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.80,1:14:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,loaded with gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.40,1:14:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter，they don't allow dump trucks on the FDR！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.50,1:14:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Connie！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.30,1:14:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！You don't want I should argue…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.30,1:14:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't argue，no matter how stupid it is！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.30,1:14:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Canine，bring it around to the back，check out the boiler room.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.50,1:14:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find anything，Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.30,1:14:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could spend a week in here with an X-ray machine
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.50,1:14:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and still not find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.70,1:14:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have a week，Charlie。You got five more minutes，
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.80,1:14:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,then we're moving up to 86th street.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.40,1:14:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're going as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.60,1:14:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's up？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.20,1:14:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane was mentioning something about the Federal Reserve building.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.10,1:14:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that right near that Wall Street bomb site we just left？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.70,1:14:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long do you want us to stay here？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.40,1:14:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The men at the stadium，stay or go？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.00,1:14:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Karl should have checked in by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.30,1:14:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.00,1:15:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay where you are。McClane may still turn up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.00,1:15:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Relax，Targo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.00,1:15:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he is still alive…he won't be talking to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.50,1:15:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the next turnoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.30,1:15:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，it's Elvis Duran，you're on the air。What's up？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.70,1:15:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,First of all，I just want to tell you what a great show you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.80,1:15:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I listen to you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.40,1:15:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，thank you。What do you want to talk about？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.90,1:15:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you know，all those cop cars screaming around everywhere？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.90,1:15:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what they're up to？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.20,1:15:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a bomb in a school.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.90,1:15:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,My cousin's a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.50,1:15:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody put a big bomb in a school somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.80,1:15:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only they don't know which one…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.00,1:15:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,so they're searching all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.80,1:15:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every school in the metropolitan area.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.50,1:15:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.80,1:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doris？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.50,1:15:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Annie？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doris，can you get ahold of my wife？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.60,1:15:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turley！Half the goddamn city just called 911！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.50,1:15:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.00,1:15:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.70,1:15:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're gone！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.50,1:15:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this guy，Houdini？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.70,1:15:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.60,1:15:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down there！Down there！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.70,1:16:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This thing got air bags？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.20,1:16:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your side does。I don't know about mi…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.40,1:16:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.50,1:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the truck，let me see the hands！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.60,1:16:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put them on the door！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.70,1:16:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't kill me！Don't shoot me！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.70,1:16:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You the truck driver？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.60,1:16:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm a beautician。Of course，I'm a truck driver！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you taking this truck？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.30,1:16:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The aqueduct.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.50,1:16:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you taking a dump truck to the racetrack for？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.40,1:16:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，the aqueduct！The a… Th-The water aqueduct！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.20,1:16:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aqueduct？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.70,1:17:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？It goes from here all the way up to the Catskill Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.20,1:17:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.20,1:17:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That！The water pipe。Goes for about 60 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.70,1:17:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，you the foreman？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.50,1:17:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,NYPD.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.20,1:17:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had any，like，extra dump trucks come through here in the last couple of minutes？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna write those fucking clowns up！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.90,1:17:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They better start paying attention to work orders…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.90,1:17:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who-Who are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.00,1:17:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，the dozen idiots who tore ass up the tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.70,1:17:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not loading up there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.90,1:17:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're loading over here！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.00,1:17:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So much for bridges and helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.30,1:17:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a map showin' me where this tunnel goes？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.30,1:17:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.80,1:17:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We run pretty much up under the sawmill until you get up to the Coffer Dam.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.70,1:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,From there on，we've already brought the water down from the reservoir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.90,1:17:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any way to get in or out of there？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.50,1:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，there's a vent shaft every two miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.80,1:17:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I mean with a truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.20,1:17:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,At the Coffer Dam。You can get a truck in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.20,1:17:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just follow the Sawmill River Parkway up there。It's about 20 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.50,1:18:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，I'm gonna meet you right there。All right？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.90,1:18:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait！Wh-What am I supposed to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.70,1:18:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going to go up to Yankee Stadium！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.60,1:18:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.50,1:18:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Get out of here！We got less than two hours！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.70,1:18:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.80,1:18:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Is somethin' wrong？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.20,1:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,480 yards of rock moved so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.70,1:18:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now that's ten times the Hoover Dam.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.80,1:18:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，there's 516 feet of rock above our heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.00,1:18:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,This part is phase three of tunnel three.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.80,1:18:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Planning for it began back in 1954…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.90,1:18:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,but construction didn't begin until June of 1970.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.90,1:18:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what the most interesting part of tunnel three is？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.60,1:18:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that，Jerry？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.50,1:18:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The valves。Each one…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.80,1:18:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a big departure from tunnels one and two.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.30,1:18:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.10,1:18:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a hell of a place to break down.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.00,1:18:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold it a minute，Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.70,1:18:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me have your hard hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.00,1:18:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a jacket？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.00,1:19:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，yeah。Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.90,1:19:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait here a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.00,1:19:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait until he gets alongside the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.20,1:19:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，fellas，Mickey O'Brien，aqueduct security.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.40,1:19:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen，we had a report of a guy comin' through here with，uh，eight reindeer…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.50,1:19:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，they said he was a jolly，old fat guy…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.50,1:19:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,with a snowy white beard，cute，little red and white suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.00,1:19:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you didn't see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.50,1:19:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's with you guys and these phones？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.80,1:19:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe this'll give me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.00,1:19:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit！Is that guy dead？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.00,1:19:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Jerry，I'm afraid he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.50,1:19:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.40,1:19:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to get ahold of a guy named Cobb。Walter Cobb。C-o-b-b.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.70,1:19:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the head of my police unit。Get him down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.80,1:19:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find him。Tell him you were with John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.90,1:19:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell him to find out who the 21st president was.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.70,1:19:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chester A。Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.70,1:20:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.60,1:20:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chester A。Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.60,1:20:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,1881-1885.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.40,1:20:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nominated vice president in 1880.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.60,1:20:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you know he was Collector of Customs right here in New York？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.00,1:20:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I didn't know that，Jerry。Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.30,1:21:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,TV's got us！TV's got us！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.80,1:21:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got to release these traffic guys！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.10,1:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Traffic jams we can take care of later.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.00,1:21:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You find out what the hell is wrong with this thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.50,1:21:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frequencies are jammed！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.40,1:21:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about Ricky？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.20,1:21:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I can't get ahold of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.50,1:21:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，Walter，Federal Reserve…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.90,1:21:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Biggest gold storage in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.40,1:21:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get a unit back down there。Find Ricky.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.70,1:21:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find out what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.90,1:21:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.30,1:21:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta hear this！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.30,1:21:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ，I thought we were going in the back way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.50,1:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the back way，Walter.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.30,1:21:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,In half an hour，you're going to have a riot at every school in this city！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.10,1:22:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll start at the top floor，put 20 men on each floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.60,1:22:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send the other 50 men down to the basement with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.10,1:22:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about McClane？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.10,1:22:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a word。I'm gettin' nothing。Busy signals.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.10,1:22:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Westchester's probably worse than we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.50,1:22:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is kind of putting all our eggs in one basket，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.00,1:22:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，what if McClane's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.40,1:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter！This is Principal Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.50,1:22:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Principal Martinez，Inspector Cobb.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.10,1:22:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you do，Inspector？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.10,1:22:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you do，Principal Martinez？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.30,1:22:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to alarm your children。I wonder if you…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.10,1:22:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,could move them all into the auditorium
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.00,1:22:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and keep them calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're coming to the dam。You can call the rear guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.30,1:22:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rear guard，you can close up now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.10,1:22:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've reached the dam。You can come up now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.30,1:23:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nils，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.20,1:23:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,you can close in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.20,1:23:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nils！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.40,1:23:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention，attention，Nils is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.00,1:23:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I repeat，Nils is dead，fuckhead。So is his pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.50,1:23:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And those four guys from the East German all-stars？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.30,1:23:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your boys down at the bank？They're gonna be a little late.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.80,1:23:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.50,1:23:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the back of the truck you're driving there's 13 billion dollars' worth in gold bullion.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.20,1:23:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder，would a deal be out of the question？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.40,1:23:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I got a deal for you。Crawl out from under that rock
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.10,1:23:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're hidin' under，and I'll drive this truck up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.60,1:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How colorful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.30,1:23:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you not to toy with him！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.60,1:23:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。That's very helpful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.80,1:23:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll jeopardize the mission and the contract！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.60,1:23:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're vulnerable 'til we reach the ship！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.10,1:23:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.40,1:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.80,1:24:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Targo！Targo！Here！Come here！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.30,1:24:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We blow the dam！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.40,1:24:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.50,1:24:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We drown him！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.00,1:24:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.50,1:24:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.40,1:24:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The janitor said this one was delivered this morning about 10：30，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.50,1:24:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not hooked up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.80,1:24:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Now take a look at the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.70,1:24:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，we drill the hinges。Get everybody out！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.60,1:27:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.50,1:27:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.30,1:27:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.40,1:27:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over here！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.00,1:27:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a hell of a way of flagging somebody down！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.70,1:27:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.70,1:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you go to Yankee Stadium？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.10,1:27:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，there's nobody there！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.40,1:27:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't see nobody？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.40,1:27:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.40,1:27:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody was following you？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.80,1:27:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm telling you，he's jerking us around！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.10,1:27:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.50,1:27:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.40,1:27:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody's following us！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.00,1:27:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.40,1:27:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not rigged。Pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.60,1:28:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'd say you could call off your search.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.30,1:28:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you stop it？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.20,1:28:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shouldn't even touch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.70,1:28:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who knows what kind of booby traps this thing's got.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.10,1:28:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about the code？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.40,1:28:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No word.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.80,1:28:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,When do we evacuate？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.10,1:28:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simon says he sees one kid leave the building，boom！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.80,1:28:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine！There's a chance that somebody's still watching，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.30,1:28:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we can't stand here with our thumb up our ass，waiting for this freaking thing to blow up！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.30,1:28:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.50,1:28:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your head down！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.40,1:28:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Zeus！Hold it steady！Hold it steady！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.30,1:28:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.00,1:28:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Outta the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.90,1:28:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go around 'em！Go around 'em！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.00,1:28:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found out who was the 21st president！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.80,1:28:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.60,1:28:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some guy named Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.20,1:28:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chester A。Arthur？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.30,1:28:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chester A。Arthur，that's it，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.40,1:29:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chester A。Arthur Elementary School？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.80,1:29:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.60,1:29:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，kids。I know you usually have assembly on Fridays，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.30,1:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,but today is special.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.90,1:29:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr.Lambert here is from the fire department…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.30,1:29:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,and today he wants us to practice a brand-new fire drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.60,1:29:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，I want you to divide in half，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.80,1:29:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I want half of you to go over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.60,1:29:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other half will go in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.90,1:29:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please do it very quietly and very quickly，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.60,1:29:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody，up，please。Teachers，please help them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.50,1:29:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire drill，my ass。That guy ain't from the fire department.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.70,1:29:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because of the radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.90,1:30:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean，like，they're after us？No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.00,1:30:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tony squealed on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.00,1:30:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.20,1:30:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.50,1:30:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.30,1:30:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me drive！Let me drive！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.80,1:30:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.40,1:30:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why the hell didn't you tell me before？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.10,1:30:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course he put the bomb up in that school！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.40,1:30:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would he do that？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.40,1:30:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make sure he got your complete attention！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.70,1:30:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find the fuse panel！Where…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.80,1:30:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.60,1:30:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The fuse panel！Where's the fuse panel on this car？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.20,1:30:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's right here。Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.10,1:30:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull out the anti-Iock brakes fuse！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.70,1:30:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！I don't know which one it is！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.70,1:30:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then yank them all out then！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.70,1:30:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put your head down！Put your head fucking down！This is gonna be really bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.70,1:30:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me。Hang the fuck on，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.70,1:31:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Oh！What the fuck happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.70,1:31:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a triple-A card？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.70,1:31:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.60,1:31:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.70,1:31:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got the janitors making a last sweep of the building right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.60,1:31:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Ms。Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.30,1:31:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.10,1:31:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，five-card stud，threes and nines are wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.80,1:31:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay down！Stay low！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.10,1:32:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.20,1:32:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Interrogating him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.30,1:32:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，what's he gonna tell you？「I'm dead.」
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.00,1:32:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I ain't gonna know 'til I ask him，am I？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.10,1:32:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go around and see
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.30,1:32:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,if there's any aspirins in that glove box.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.40,1:32:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No way。You do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.10,1:32:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten quarters。The guy in the dump truck had ten quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.50,1:32:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，maybe they were making long-distance phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.30,1:32:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。It's for the bridge。It's for the toll on the bridge！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.60,1:32:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！There！Down on the wharf！Dump trucks！Right there！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.70,1:32:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ！They got it loaded on the ship already！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.00,1:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！How about the Coast Guard？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.60,1:32:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'd take 'em an hour to get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.70,1:32:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.50,1:32:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can jump！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.50,1:32:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.40,1:32:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can jump！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.30,1:33:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're out of your fucking mind！It's 100 feet down to the deck！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.30,1:33:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but not to the crane it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.00,1:33:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cables'd cut you in half.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.90,1:33:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.10,1:33:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bullshit。Get down。Look in the back of that car for some gloves.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.80,1:33:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Six booby traps，four dead ends…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.40,1:33:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a partridge in a pear tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.40,1:33:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，honey，let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.40,1:33:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna have sort of a race.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.00,1:33:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，when I say go，I want you all to run like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.70,1:33:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of you，you follow the police officer and the firemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.70,1:33:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys are my front runners，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.80,1:33:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter，think we're cutting this a little thin？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.20,1:33:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Joe，we're gonna wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.10,1:33:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane still may get the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.00,1:33:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Line me up with that crane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.30,1:33:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！There！Right there！Right there！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.30,1:33:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right there，you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.30,1:33:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I see it now，I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.90,1:33:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！This is gonna take a miracle！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.40,1:33:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep your fingers crossed。Okay，swing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.70,1:33:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，come on，come on，you almost got it。Almost，almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.80,1:33:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，all right！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.80,1:34:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you going？Are you in a hurry？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.90,1:34:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going first this time，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.70,1:34:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have the intercom rigged，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.70,1:34:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walter，the kids may be fine，but you wait much longer…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.20,1:34:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna pee in my pants！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.90,1:34:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna wait，Connie.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.90,1:34:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Six more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.40,1:34:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.20,1:34:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.90,1:34:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.00,1:34:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.00,1:34:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go，man！Go，go，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.30,1:35:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，boy！Am I glad you talked me out of jumping.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.00,1:35:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，fuck。Get his feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.80,1:36:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We go find Simon，drag him to the ship-to-shore radio…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.20,1:36:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,and beat that fucking code out of him。Here，take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.90,1:36:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's it work？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.90,1:36:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know how to shoot a gun？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.20,1:36:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，all brothers don't know how to shoot guns，
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.70,1:36:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,you racist motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.10,1:36:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sue me。Just yank back on that and pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.80,1:36:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.50,1:36:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.30,1:36:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。Just don't shoot yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.20,1:36:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，don't be no hero。You find 'em，you come get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.90,1:38:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have the autopilot set？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.50,1:38:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.80,1:38:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.10,1:38:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't fuckin' move！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.80,1:38:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，the Samaritan.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.30,1:38:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the goddamn code！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.60,1:38:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Code？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.10,1:38:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！You mean for the school？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.90,1:38:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.80,1:38:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You call in that code…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.80,1:38:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,right now，or I blow your sick ass into the next world！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.50,1:38:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that's what you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.30,1:38:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta take the safety catch off.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.90,1:38:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Goddamn！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.20,1:38:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？That works。Now，where's McClane？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.50,1:39:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.30,1:39:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said，「Don't shoot.」
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.90,1:39:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Charlie，we're gonna have to go with the evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.80,1:39:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna go！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.00,1:39:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you heard the man！Let's go！Let's go！Move it！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.60,1:39:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna go！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.40,1:39:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,On my mark！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.70,1:39:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five，four，three，two，one，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.00,1:39:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Let's go！Let's go！Hustle！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.70,1:39:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's do it！Okay，gang，let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.40,1:39:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go。Go，go！Hip-hop！Hip-hop！Come on，everybody！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.40,1:40:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are they doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.80,1:40:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo！Where you goin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.70,1:40:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，where you goin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.90,1:40:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see you all dead，little man，policeman…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.30,1:40:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.10,1:40:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I'm that fucking Energizer bunny.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.80,1:40:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going now，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.50,1:40:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going now，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.30,1:40:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm gonna arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.50,1:40:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew it was bullshit。There's nobody watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.00,1:40:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to get Charlie out。Let's move，Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.80,1:40:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to get Charlie out。Let's move，Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.90,1:41:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me another 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.30,1:41:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It takes a minute-fifteen if you're a kid，Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.50,1:41:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and，last I looked，you weren't too light on your feet。Now move！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.10,1:41:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.90,1:41:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ！Get 'em out of there！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.60,1:41:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rooms are locked。The rooms are locked！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.40,1:41:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Joe！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.50,1:41:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.30,1:41:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help us！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.90,1:41:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on，Walter？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.80,1:41:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We still have kids in the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.20,1:41:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.50,1:41:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Charlie！Get out of there！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.00,1:41:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ever see that show called The Addams Family？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.00,1:41:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They got a motherfucker on there called 「Lurch」！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.90,1:41:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't think I'm gonna let you get to that gun，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.00,1:41:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.70,1:42:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four！Four！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.90,1:42:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck it！Get out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.20,1:42:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are they，Walter？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.40,1:42:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still in.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.50,1:42:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No guts，no glory.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.60,1:42:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we get to the roof，we can jump to the next building！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.00,1:42:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.20,1:42:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.30,1:42:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.80,1:42:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get 'em up here！Get 'em up here！Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.30,1:42:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mayday！Mayday，Bridgeport Coast Guard。Bridgeport Coast Guard，come in！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.20,1:43:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，kids！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.50,1:43:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！It's too far！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.10,1:43:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over here！Down！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.60,1:43:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No guts，no glory.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.00,1:43:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a big，fucking white fucking boat in the middle of the harbor！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.20,1:43:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please stay on the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.20,1:43:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，sure，I'll stay on the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.20,1:43:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pancake syrup？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.60,1:43:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stupid！Stupid！Asshole！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.40,1:44:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.80,1:44:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was never any bomb in the school，was there？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.20,1:44:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course not。I'm a soldier not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.00,1:44:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even though I sometimes work for monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.10,1:44:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，the real bomb is on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.50,1:44:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Coast Guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.20,1:44:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was tellin' 'em where the boat was.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.50,1:44:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Game over，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.30,1:44:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not quite over.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.40,1:44:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bridgeport Coast Guard，come in，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.20,1:44:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They put you on hold？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.80,1:44:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,She told me to stay on the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.30,1:44:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God，I love this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.80,1:44:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，your brother was an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.70,1:44:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，he really was an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.90,1:44:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was，he was an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.90,1:44:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，you got his number。Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.50,1:44:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.50,1:45:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me。Would you help Mr.McClane below？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.50,1:45:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.00,1:45:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，do you have the communique？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.80,1:45:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bridgeport Radio，come in，please。Bridgeport…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.60,1:45:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coast Guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.70,1:45:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you there，dear？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.60,1:45:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.60,1:45:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have the ability to record a message？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.50,1:45:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.40,1:45:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then please begin now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.70,1:45:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.40,1:45:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a communique from the CRF.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.20,1:45:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,For too long the West has conspired to steal the wealth of the world…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.10,1:45:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,consigning the balance of humanity to economic starvation.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.90,1:45:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today，we will level the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.00,1:45:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a few minutes，the contents of the Federal Reserve Bank…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.30,1:45:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,the gold your economies are built on…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.20,1:45:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,will be redistributed by explosive…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.40,1:45:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,across the bottom of the Long Island Sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.10,1:45:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you are not in gridlock，I invite you to come and watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.10,1:46:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna blow it all up？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.00,1:46:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.50,1:46:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are some gentlemen in the Middle East…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.20,1:46:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,who seem to think that they'll make a great deal of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.00,1:46:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,See the men safely off the ship，and I'll see you in the port-side launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.00,1:46:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell's all this got to do with killing McClane？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.10,1:46:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Life has its little bonuses.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.70,1:46:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't I hear you say，you didn't even like your brother？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.10,1:46:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a difference，you know，between not liking one's brother
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.50,1:46:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,and not caring when some dumb Irish flatfoot drops him out of a window.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.20,1:46:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I didn't even know that motherfucker！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.60,1:46:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，but I never invited you aboard this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.70,1:46:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No riddle's gonna stop this motherfucker？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.10,1:46:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No code，no riddle，no fancy little countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.30,1:46:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，fuckhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.40,1:46:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you，fuckhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.50,1:46:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's just one thing I gotta know.You got any aspirins？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.00,1:46:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've had a bad fucking headache all day long.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.80,1:46:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.90,1:46:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.20,1:47:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is the gold？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.30,1:47:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's betrayed us。The containers are filled with that！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.70,1:47:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I hadn't have saved your fucking ass，I wouldn't be sittin' here with you…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.60,1:47:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,about to blow up with a hundred billion dollars in fucking gold！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.90,1:48:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，well，I got some bad news.You're only gonna blow up with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.20,1:48:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.00,1:48:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no gold on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.30,1:48:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know that？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.30,1:48:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause I know the man，I know the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.20,1:48:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only thing better than blowin' up a hundred billion dollars' worth of gold…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.90,1:48:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,is making people think you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.20,1:48:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？Well，where is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.50,1:48:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。He must've switched it back on the docks somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.70,1:48:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，that's supposed to make me feel better？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.30,1:48:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.60,1:48:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're wrong about the other thing，though.You're not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.60,1:48:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？You know some cop trick about handcuffs that's gonna get us out of this？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.80,1:48:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，use a key.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.60,1:48:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know how to pick this lock？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.00,1:48:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this some Black shit again？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.10,1:48:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now will you stop with that racial shit？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.40,1:48:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you a fucking locksmith or not？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.90,1:48:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，yeah，I could do it if I had something to do it with.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.50,1:48:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about a splinter of that cable I slid down？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.30,1:48:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That might work.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.10,1:48:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.70,1:48:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.80,1:48:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.90,1:48:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's that？Is that big enough？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.60,1:48:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit，yeah。Yeah，that might work.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.80,1:48:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，I'm gonna drop it in your hands。Cup your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.80,1:48:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't drop this motherfucker，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.60,1:48:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it。Get it right。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.60,1:48:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.00,1:48:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,One…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.90,1:49:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two，spit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.10,1:49:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.50,1:49:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，come on。Move your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.10,1:49:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay。Damn，McClane，I was just startin' to like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.60,1:49:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？Well，don't。I'm an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.40,1:49:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talkin' about now？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.40,1:49:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lied to you，Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.70,1:49:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,About what？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.40,1:49:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remember I said Weiss found that bomb up in Harlem？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.20,1:49:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They found it down in Chinatown.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.00,1:49:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！Oh，now，that's low！Even for a white motherfucker…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.20,1:49:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you I was an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.00,1:49:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.20,1:49:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.90,1:49:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it was the only way I could get you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.90,1:49:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-huh。You got a wife，McClane？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.10,1:49:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.30,1:49:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm surprised anybody could stay with you long enough to be married.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.70,1:49:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，she didn't stick around too long。We're sort of separated.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.90,1:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck is 「sort of separated」？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.20,1:49:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，she was in L.A.，I was in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.50,1:49:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Had a fight on the phone，she hung up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.50,1:49:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't call her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.20,1:49:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long ago was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.50,1:49:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,About a year ago now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.90,1:49:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,About a year ago
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.30,1:50:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you laughing about？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.20,1:50:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You threw away your marriage because you were too fucking stupid to pick up the phone？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.10,1:50:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You think that's funny，huh？You laugh at other people's misfortunes？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.40,1:50:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I bet you blame that shit on your wife too，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.40,1:50:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，my wife is a very stubborn woman。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.40,1:50:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，you better stop fucking laughing and undo these cuffs！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.10,1:50:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm almost there！There。How's that for concentration？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.20,1:50:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.90,1:50:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.80,1:50:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！I dropped the thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.70,1:50:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.40,1:50:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Where is it！Where'd it go？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.90,1:50:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just find it，find it，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.90,1:50:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't fucking see it！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.60,1:50:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.50,1:50:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I made it mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.60,1:50:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，McClane！Get the fuck out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.10,1:50:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fucking do something！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.30,1:50:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn it，McClane！Listen to me！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.60,1:50:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.10,1:50:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a hard enough time getting through the day
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.00,1:50:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,without having your death on my conscience，man.Shut the fuck up，and think！All right？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.80,1:50:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay。Tools，tools。Check the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.50,1:50:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no time！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.30,1:50:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell's it doing now？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.60,1:50:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's mixing.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.50,1:51:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.50,1:51:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.40,1:51:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get ready。Lean forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.40,1:51:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.20,1:51:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lean forward！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.30,1:51:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.20,1:51:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，it's gonna go fast！Lean forward！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.90,1:51:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No，no，no，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.80,1:51:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lean forward！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.60,1:51:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get ready！Move your hands！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.60,1:51:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！Motherfuckin' shit！Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.70,1:51:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Let's go！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.60,1:51:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，goddamn！Goddamn！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.70,1:51:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.60,1:51:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，fuck！My leg！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.10,1:51:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Go，go，
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.00,1:51:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,go，go，go！Jump stairs！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.50,1:51:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.00,1:51:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！Oh，damn it！Which way？Let's go！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.30,1:51:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down here to the back of the boat！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.70,1:51:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.60,1:51:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.80,1:51:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！Down here in the back！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.20,1:52:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's he doin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.70,1:52:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got shot in the leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.50,1:52:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.70,1:52:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How about you？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.80,1:52:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。Did you get Ricky out of there？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.20,1:52:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，they found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.50,1:52:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you gonna be all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.00,1:52:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got a bad headache。Think they're mad at me？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.30,1:52:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.80,1:52:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll get to you eventually，
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.00,1:52:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,but right now they're busy with this salvage operation，I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.40,1:52:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Dr-Dredges！Dredges！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.80,1:52:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're just wasting their time。There's no gold down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.20,1:52:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.20,1:52:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,He took it with him。He beat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.90,1:52:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，he beat all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.50,1:52:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wasn't playing against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.80,1:52:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck that，McClane！You're still alive，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.60,1:52:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，aren't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.70,1:52:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。So we lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.60,1:53:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lambert，would you give him a quarter？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.00,1:53:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.20,1:53:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's collect from John.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.90,1:53:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，uh，Carmen，just tell them you'll accept the charges.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.40,1:53:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The son of a bitch had aspirin.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.80,1:53:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's John。Yeah，I'm hangin' in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.30,1:53:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is Holly there？Yeah，I'll hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.10,1:53:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zeus！Hold up！Whoa！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.80,1:54:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yesterday…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.50,1:54:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yesterday we were an army with no country.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.70,1:54:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we have to decide which country we want to buy！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.80,1:54:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And remember…this is all due to the g-g-g-gullibility…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.80,1:54:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,of the New York Police Department！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.20,1:54:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Police Department！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.50,1:55:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant。Take over.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.60,1:55:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，listen up！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.10,1:55:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,First squad，you muster out in half an hour in the school bus！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.10,1:55:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No rush.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.70,1:55:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Herr Jurgen，
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.20,1:55:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,you'll be the padre！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.00,1:56:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lights！Douse those lights！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.80,1:56:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，dick-head！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.70,1:56:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I come at a bad time？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.00,1:56:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa！I think she's pissed at you，McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.30,1:57:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's under us right now。Come on back around。Come on back around.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.30,1:57:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's right！Run，motherfuckers！- Zeus，what do you got out of your side？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.50,1:57:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look like roaches with the lights comin' on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.10,1:57:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we going to Nova Scotia？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.80,1:57:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You go with the trucks。I have something personal to finish.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.10,1:57:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go to work！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.80,1:57:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right！Run，motherfuckers！The exterminators are here！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.80,1:57:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.30,1:57:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck？Oh，shit！Fuck it！There's smoke back here！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.90,1:58:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a chopper behind us！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.20,1:58:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a gun on board？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.90,1:58:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.90,1:58:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try and get the fuckin' chopper！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.00,1:58:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't see a goddamn thing！Hold it still！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.90,1:58:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.30,1:58:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.60,1:58:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean，「Oh，shit」？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.10,1:58:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，hang on，hang on！We're going down！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.00,1:58:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,See this high tension wire？See this wire？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.00,1:58:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，McClane！What the fuck…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.30,1:58:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，we got smoke！We got fuckin' smoke and shit flyin' on me here！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.60,1:58:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Truck！Truck！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.60,1:58:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on。Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.10,1:58:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！We gotta get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.60,1:58:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna start shootin' at us any second！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.00,1:58:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get him outta here！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.80,1:58:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.60,1:58:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The beIt's stuck！I can't get it off！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.50,1:58:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！Here he comes！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.40,1:58:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't get out，McClane！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.40,1:58:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get him outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.50,1:58:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you goin'？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.20,1:59:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try and get his attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.70,1:59:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.30,1:59:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just keeps gettin' better and better.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.90,1:59:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had no idea Canada could be this much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.60,1:59:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me something to shoot at。Come on，hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.30,1:59:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show me that smilin' face.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.70,2:00:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say hello to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.70,2:00:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.90,2:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yippie-ki-yay，motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.90,2:00:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like you got his attention.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.70,2:00:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.80,2:00:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think we should call a fire truck？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.40,2:00:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，fuck him。Let him cook.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.60,2:00:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.40,2:00:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.10,2:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.50,2:00:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I left Holly hangin' on hold.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.20,2:00:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aw，call her back.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.40,2:00:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。She's gonna be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.10,2:00:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.30,2:01:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.40,2:01:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like I said，she's a very stubborn woman.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.10,2:01:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，she'd have to be to stay married to you.
